<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PRO" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Chanlai Lawng</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chanlai Lawng</para>
  <para style="toc2">Chanlai Lawng</para>
  <para style="mt1">Chanlai Lawng</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow Sawlawmawn chekhai, now arui khin dow 900-700 BC takra kowi chekhai. Mami bowih kowi dow napela prengia kownkow chanlaira laiklow arui uowi ahuma chekhai. Naiawngün chanlaira laiklow dow meng iawng ruiah khai. Naiawng ruila mih auan dow amatni lak-e kowh lang iuk miuüa changla mih atawi iawng malauüa klanguüa hawmh hang pacham ta chang lah pakowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chanlai Lawng bowih ruila mih auan dow 1:1-7 uan kowi arui uowi chekhai. Nami auan dow klanguüa lowk ia kowi chanlaira hai prengia iung napeah kown mih chekhai. Naiawng che aia kowi peah khai hanow aia kowh chownglawng dow naiung kown, now angak hownia aia nalang tahen kown. Nami lawnguan kowi Chanlai Lawng 9:10 uan kowi arui uowi mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih dow uown ka chanlaira mih chekhai, chimsaima mih Thurai kowi tuk mih dow chanlaira uowi kowh chekhai,” pakhai. Chanlai Lawng bowih dow mang Sawlawmawn ruiah mih hai akeng miuüa ruiah mih lawnguan hown kowh ruiah mih chekhai. Mami bowih kowi dow tawng iawng chow ngeuüa kowi nakruitownah kown mih lawnguan kowi arui uowi chekhai. Nakowi dow ran dawma mih masiuüa, abawrima mih maru, abualama mih maru, tüng pe atawi khe kunmarau mih maru hai aiungma mih masiuüa lawnguan kowi arui uowi chekhai. Nami klen kowi ni towng kowh chownglawng lawnguan kowi paw arui uowi chekhai. Naiawngün dow akhawr awng, dawngthawnguan, chauüa kowi nathawpah maru kown mih, dai lai hown krawi chang iung mih, anowm nadowi mih laiklow tek mih, laih iah, klowkchak, buk kow, chowra, cha büm mih hai pe bümsua mih lawnguanün chekhai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Prengia: Prengia pami dow tatüng tasangra hownia kowh kaah mih chap chekhai. Prengia dow sowm hownia kowh aiawng uowi mih chap nadowi. Naiawng rakowi prengia hai chanlaira dow auan lang ditchow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Chanlaira: Chanlaira pami dow Thurai hownia kowh kaah mih chap chekhai. Chanlaira dow cham tatüng tasang dowi chepaw nowngia uowi chekhai. Baibul kowi che a-i mü hanow Sawlawmawn kaah mih chanlaira dow Thurai hownia kowh chekhai. Nami dow cham tatüng tasangra hownia kowh aia kaah mih nadowi.</para>
  <para style="ili">Bümsua: Bümsua pami dow kuk pah lik pah tapaw tape tangka mih kowi kowh tek pe mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Tasin taken: Tasin taken pami dow kowmatia krungchak miachak maru-uüa kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Chanlai Lawng ruila mih auan 1:1-7</para>
  <para style="io1">Prengia iung hai prengia ngak lawnguan kowi Sawlawmawn kowh prengia lai 1:8-9:18</para>
  <para style="io1">Ni towng kowh chownglawng lawnguan kowi Sawlawmawn kowh prengia lai 10:1-22:16</para>
  <para style="io1">Prengiama miuüa kowh prengia lai 22:17-24:34</para>
  <para style="io1">Sawlawmawn kowh akeng mih prengia lai 25:1-29:27</para>
  <para style="io1">Agur kowh laiklow 30:1-33</para>
  <para style="io1">Mang Lemuel kowi a-u tüngsangah mih laiklow 3:1-9</para>
  <para style="io1">Aiungma mih masi hai u lawnguan kowi kowh meng 3:10-31</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PRO 1" />
  <para style="s">Chanlai Lawng ruila mih auan</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 1:1" />Maiawngün dow mang Sawlawmawn kowh chanlai lawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:1">aia dow Israel mang David kowh chapa chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 1:2" />Maiawngün ruila mih dow maru nakala chanlaira hai prengia kownkow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:2">aiung angak tukra maru nakala ngamlam kownkow,<verse eid="PRO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 1:3" />lowkkowlowk aiungma hown naia taiua uowila kownkow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:3">lahawm taka iawng, anowmma hai aiungma naia uowila kownkow,<verse eid="PRO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 1:4" />prengia uowi dowi miuüa naia kala prengia kownkow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:4">tukra hai aiung angak tukra klanguüa hawmh naia kala kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 1:5" />Chanlai miuüa dow maiawngün prengia lai pacham sünta hai pacham tasang lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:5">now prengia chakma miuüa dow mami ta hanow aiungma pacham tuk uowi lah.<verse eid="PRO 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 1:6" />Nahanow laiuat hai abüpma mih laiklow naia tukta kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:6">now chanlai miuüa kowh laiklow hai ta-aw lai natukta kown towbowt.<verse eid="PRO 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 1:7" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih dow tukra uown tarowng mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:7">Nachenganchepaw bualama miuüa dow chanlaira hai pringhawi kowi nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Klanguüa hawmh vüi kowi kowh prengia lai</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 1:8" />Chapa ow, en pa kowh prengia pek sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:8">en u sang en mih hangkow nuata diah.<verse eid="PRO 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 1:9" />Naiawngün dow en lu kowi kowh napawng klangiungma mih iawng naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:9">now en ngawng kowi kowh pauleng klangiungma mih iawng naown kown.<verse eid="PRO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 1:10" />Chapa ow, maru ngakuüa hawla en lup ngak chang chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:10">hang cham tawi tarü diah.<verse eid="PRO 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 1:11" />Maru natek en kown mih, “Anging hown uang tawi chaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:11">sai maru kownkow a-i hawt pawm maru lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:11">angak uowi dowi mih maru kowi khümah kownkow a-i hawt tapet lah.<verse eid="PRO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 1:12" />Amatni kowi a-i hawt khümah khe asingma hai kow iungma chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:12">a-i powtta pe khowk khe dow akowngma a-i ta towla hüah kown.<verse eid="PRO 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 1:13" />Nahanow asung khakma mih uanh ahuma a-i naka kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:13">now a-i kala mih uanh hown a-i kowh kim dow atekma a-i natowah kown.<verse eid="PRO 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 1:14" />Anging hown en paw uang tawi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:14">a-i cham kuah mih uanh maten a-i taretah kown towbowt,” napa kown.<verse eid="PRO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 1:15" />Chapa ow, naiawngün maru-uüa hown hang cham tawi taiua ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:15">naiawngün maru-uüa kowh tiama kowi hang cham tawi mang ba.<verse eid="PRO 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 1:16" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow chang angak kownkow towk iowh reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:16">amatni kowh khawk dow cham sai maru kownkow cham iowmla reng mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 1:17" />Nakhüm uakling kown nau kowh uakling khi khe thang pe powk hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:17">uakling dow nataia kown mih tuk rakowi cham lang tahen reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 1:18" />Tawkche naiawng cham pawm maru mih dow amatni matia kowng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:18">amatni dow amatni matia leng kowi tasowk reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 1:19" />Lawpha kowh angak hown krawi kram miuüa dow naiawng own reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:19">angak hown kowh kaah mih uanh dow paw asak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chanlaira hawk klow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 1:20" />Chanlaira dow tiama towng krawi haw reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:20">chanlaira dow chi kowi prang kowi krawi tüng klow reng.<verse eid="PRO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 1:21" />Tiakrum kowi kowh maru kawm dawng kowi chanlaira dow krawi haw reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:21">chanlaira dow tapplawt re-e maiawng krawi tek reng,<verse eid="PRO 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 1:22" />“Bualama miuüa low, mün ni tak chow bualama uowi kown mih enni nau?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:22">
    <char style="w">Prawngren</char> maru miuüa low, prawngren maru mih hown mün ni tak chow enni napiaw kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:22">Aiung angak tukra uowi dowi miuüa low, mün ni tak chow tukra kowi enni nasui kown?<verse eid="PRO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 1:23" />Ang kowh pringhawi laiklow che enni sünta khai panü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:23">ang nape enni chanlaira hai tukra kown chowdiah.<verse eid="PRO 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 1:24" />Ang haw enni reng chepaw enni dow sünta ang dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:24">ang iaw enni rut khowk chepaw miapaw enni klang ang dowi.<verse eid="PRO 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 1:25" />Ang kowh prengia laiklow kowi enni pe ching dowi chedow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:25">tüng enni atawi ama mih kowi paw enni nauta dowi chedow,<verse eid="PRO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 1:26" />enni kowh piakra ang khi hanow ang naren enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:26">enni kla phih kla tan khe ang nachangla enni rensi küakau kown.<verse eid="PRO 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 1:27" />Liku iawng enni luk kowi phih uang ting chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:27">akrat pusa dawng kowi enni uowi chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 1:27">ang nachangla enni rensi küakau kown.<verse eid="PRO 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 1:28" />Nami khin khe prengia uowi dowi miuüa dow nahaw ang kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:28">Tawkche amatni kowi dow ang naklangah kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 1:28">Nakhowk khe amatni dow nakrawi cham ang kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:28">Tawkche amatni dow nakrum ang kown nadowi.<verse eid="PRO 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 1:29" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow tukra kowi sui khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:29">now CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram kown nau büah dowi.<verse eid="PRO 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 1:30" />Amatni dow ang kowh prengia lai chün kown nau dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:30">ang kowh pringhawi laiklow mih amatni dow sünta kown nau dowi.<verse eid="PRO 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 1:31" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh lup sung dow amatni naka kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:31">amatni kowh lup rakowi amatni kowh chownglawng dow nakrat kown.<verse eid="PRO 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 1:32" />Bualama miuüa dow tiama tawi kowi mang rakowi nakowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:32">aiung angak tuak dowi miuüa dow tawngpaw tuak dowi rakowi napiak kown.<verse eid="PRO 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 1:33" />Nachenganchepaw ang laiklow sünta miuüa dow thaulangma nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 1:33">amatni dow angak chap nauang ting kown mih kowi nakram kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="PRO 1:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PRO 2" />
  <para style="s">Chanlaira hown kowh maratra</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 2:1" />Chapa ow, ang laiklow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:1">ang kowh ana pek maten sak kowi towah diah.<verse eid="PRO 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 2:2" />Chanlaira laiklow prakowi pe param diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:2">aiung angak tuk müa prakowi pe ching diah.<verse eid="PRO 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 2:3" />Prengia iung krawi lü reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:3">aiung angak tukra krawi cham reng diah.<verse eid="PRO 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 2:4" />Krawi cham tai mih iawng krawi cham prengia diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:4">krawi cham asung khakma mih uanh iawng krawi cham prengia diah.<verse eid="PRO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 2:5" />Nahanow CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih krang en natuk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:5">now Thurai lawnguan kowi natukla kown mih tukra en naka kown towbowt.<verse eid="PRO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 2:6" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow chanlaira pek mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:6">prengia hai tukra dow aia nawr hownia uang lawt reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 2:7" />Aia dow saktuak achi anawmma miuüa vüi krüm pe chanlaira reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:7">anowmma uowi miuüa vüi aia dow kawngma iawng tawi towkala reng.<verse eid="PRO 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 2:8" />Aia dow tara nowm chet miuüa kowi mingkhetah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:8">aia dow aia kaah sakowm miuüa kowi towkala reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 2:9" />Ang laiklow che en sünta khai panü dow tataing mih, taka mih hai anowmma mih en natuk kown chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:9">ang tek en mih laiklow che en chün khai panü dow aiungma mih tiama maten en natuk kown chowdiah.<verse eid="PRO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 2:10" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow en sak kowi mih chanlaira nauang kup bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:10">now tukra mih en sak kowi nape en awmrawmra bowt kown.<verse eid="PRO 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 2:11" />Aiung angak tukra dow angak hownia nahen en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:11">en kowh tukra dow en kowh kangchawng mih iawng naown kown.<verse eid="PRO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 2:12" />Chanlaira dow maru ngakuüa tiama hownia nahen en kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:12">nami chanlaira dow tek dai lai miuüa hownia paw nahen en kown,<verse eid="PRO 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13-15" style="v" sid="PRO 2:13-15" />now aiiuma mih tiama kowi namang kownkow atengma mih tiama nuata miuüa hownia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:13-15">chang lup ngak khe hai tiama ngak kowi mang khe kowh awmrawm miuüa hownia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 2:13-15">tiama akuima mih kowi hai piakra tiama kowi mang miuüa hownia nami dow nahen en kown.<verse eid="PRO 2:13-15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 2:16" />Chanlaira chowtaih chang iang mih masiuüa hownia nahen en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:16">chanlaira chowtaih lai ding lai sau tek kiakma mih masiuüa hownia nahen en kown.<verse eid="PRO 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 2:17" />Naiawng mih masiuüa dow ning diachow hownia kowh aia tachawngah mih hua kowi khua mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:17">aia dow tachawng khe kowh Thurai pur kowi kowh laikham piak mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 2:18" />Amatni kowh kim kowi che en cham kup hanow kowngra prakowi en mang mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:18">amatni hown en cham taiua hanow kowngra hown en cham tatawn mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 2:19" />Amatni tut-e cham kowi miuüa dow katpaw uang plan dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:19">amatni tut-e cham tawi miuüa dow singra tia kowi katpaw uang plan dowi bowt.<verse eid="PRO 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 2:20" />Naiawng rakowi maru iunguüa kowh tiama kowi en namang kown takla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:20">now achinawmma miuüa uowi iawng en nauowi kown takla.<verse eid="PRO 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 2:21" />A-i kowh pren kowi naia uowi kown mih dow maru iunguüa chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:21">a-i kowh pren kowi nanowng uowi kown mih dow achinawmma miuüa chowtaih.<verse eid="PRO 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 2:22" />Nachenganchepaw maru ngakuüa kowi dow pren hownia nahenta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 2:22">kaah sakowm dowi mih maru-uüa kowi dow pren hownia namitta kown.<verse eid="PRO 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PRO 3" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG luk kowi neplawng nesak diah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 3:1" />Chapa ow, ang tüng ang sang en mih hangkow tamata diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:1">ang kowh ana pek mih sak kowi towah reng diah.<verse eid="PRO 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 3:2" />Naiawng en chang hanow en kowh chowng nadawng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:2">now en kowh chownglawng dow aiungma nauowi kown.<verse eid="PRO 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 3:3" />Kaah sakowmma mih rah kowi mapaw hangkow nuata diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:3">achur uowi dowi mih sakraura kowi asima dowkta hüah reng diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 3:3">Naiawngün dow en natukla reng kownkow ngawng kowi ü-ah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:3">naiawngün dow en naka tuakla reng kownkow sak kowi ruiah diah.<verse eid="PRO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 3:4" />Naiawng che en chang hanow Thurai hai lusa maru pur kowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:4">saksing sanara hai ming iung nang iung en naka kown.<verse eid="PRO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 3:5" />En kowh sak maiow hown CHAKRAMANG luk kowi neplawng nesak diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:5">en matia kowh aiung angak tukra luk kowi hangkow owmsak diah.<verse eid="PRO 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 3:6" />Lowra mih lup en chang khe CHAKRAMANG kowi tuakla reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:6">nahanow aia dow tiama iung mih natüng en reng kown taih.<verse eid="PRO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 3:7" />En kowh prengia uowima pami hangkow ka tuak diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:7">CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kramah reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:7">now lup ngak changra hownia cham lang tahen reng diah.<verse eid="PRO 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 3:8" />Nahanow en kowh kow mih aiungma nauowi reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:8">now en kowh kow mih khawt paw nalang khawt ngamlam kown.<verse eid="PRO 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 3:9" />En kowh dawngthawnguan hown CHAKRAMANG kowi tüng pe ringkawra reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:9">en kowh luprak müng hown aia kowi tüng pe ringkawra reng diah.<verse eid="PRO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 3:10" />Nahanow en kowh chapam kowi luprak atekma nauowi reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:10">now atowk rah takowi dowi mowr grep tui paw en naka reng kown.<verse eid="PRO 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 3:11" />Chapa ow, CHAKRAMANG hawi en khe hang kunmarau diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:11">aia nang en mih khin khe mapaw hauang sak-hiah diah.<verse eid="PRO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 3:12" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow sakrauah mih chauüa kowi dow u-pa pring hawiah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:12">nami powm iawng CHAKRAMANG paw aia sakrauah mih kowi dow pring hawiah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 3:13" />Ka chanlaira mih maru dow prasira uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:13">now ka prengia mih maru dow awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 3:14" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow tai lak-e asung lang uowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:14">Nami dow kuh lak-e paw asung lang uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 3:15" />Chanlaira dow asung khakma mih hua lak-e lang iung.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:15">Nami dow en nauah mih chap maten lak-e asung lang uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 3:16" />Chanlaira dow chowngdawng sakklangra nowngia pe en chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:16">Nami dow dawngthawnguan hai ringkawra paw nowngia pe en chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 3:17" />Chanlaira dow piawra tiama kowi napawla en reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:17">chanlaira en kowh uowi now apiaw apama mih chownglawng en naka kown.<verse eid="PRO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 3:18" />Chanlaira ka miuüa dow ka masing sih mih iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:18">ka chanlaira mih maru-uüa dow prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 3:19" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh chanlaira hown lusa mih thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:19">aia kowh tukra hown mukuang dow CHAKRAMANG thawpah mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 3:20" />Krawng dak kowi kowh tui dow aia kowh tukra hown aia uang pe lawtah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:20">now uang tui kowi dow uangnim hownia aia uang pe dowah khai.<verse eid="PRO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 3:21" />Chapa ow, prengia hai chanlaira laiklow mih dowkta chen diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:21">naiawngün dow en tamata dowi kownkow pela pe ching reng diah.<verse eid="PRO 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 3:22" />Nahanow naiawngün prengia hai chanlaira mih nape en singra kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:22">ü kuh leng khe kowh klangiung iawng en kowh chownglawng naklangiung kown.<verse eid="PRO 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 3:23" />En cham mang cham kat chepaw tawngpaw en naown kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:23">en cham mang cham kat mih khin khe en natatheu kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PRO 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 3:24" />En mawk mih khin khe paw en nakram kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:24">en müi mih khin khe paw asowrma en naia müi kown towbowt.<verse eid="PRO 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 3:25" />En luk kowi phih uang ting chepaw hangkow kram diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:25">maru ngakuüa piak mih en khi chepaw hangkow takrow diah.<verse eid="PRO 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 3:26" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow naming nakhet en reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:26">leng kowi en nacham tasowk kown mih hownia aia dow nalawng en reng kown.<verse eid="PRO 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 3:27" />Akhowng takla miuüa kowi dow en ia khowng now khowngah reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:27">naiawng miuüa kowi dow ia hanow khowngah dowi matchang hang uowi diah.<verse eid="PRO 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 3:28" />Maru uang lü khowng khe akhowng takla mih kowi dow ia hanow khowngah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:28">“Powt diah, tharau khe uang iang, tharau khe ang pe en sow,” pami hang tek diah.<verse eid="PRO 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 3:29" />En tainau-uüa kowi nachangah angak kown mih hangkow ka tuak diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:29">amatni dow en kowi owmsak kowh asowrma tawi uowi mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 3:30" />Tawngpaw chang en angak dowi miuüa hown dow hangkow taran diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:30">amatni hown dow alow akan uowi dowi matchang hangkow taran diah.<verse eid="PRO 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 3:31" />Krawi chang nowng mih maru kowi khita now hangkow irsi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:31">naiawng mih maru kowh chowm krang uowi krang paw hang tawi iua diah.<verse eid="PRO 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 3:32" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow chang angak mih maru kowi dow CHAKRAMANG sui chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:32">nachenganchepaw saktuak achinawmma mih maru hown dow CHAKRAMANG taklawp taiua reng.<verse eid="PRO 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 3:33" />Maru ngakuüa kim kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh piati uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:33">now maru iunguüa kim kowi dow Thurai kowh prasi uowi reng.<verse eid="PRO 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 3:34" />Prawngren maru miuüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG paw prawng renah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:34">now khamsum khamdaw miuüa kowi dow aia saksing sanaah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 3:35" />Prengia uowi miuüa dow naka ringkawra reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 3:35">Tawkche prengia uowi dowi miuüa dow naka rukrai reng kown.<verse eid="PRO 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PRO 4" />
  <para style="s">Pa kowh prengia lai</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 4:1" />Chapa ow, en kowh pa pe en prengia mih sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:1">aiung angak tukra nakala kown mih prakowi pe ching reng diah.<verse eid="PRO 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 4:2" />Ang tüngsang en mih dow aiung chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:2">Naiawng rakowi ang kowh ana pek chün diah.<verse eid="PRO 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 4:3" />Ang paw asowmchow khe dow en iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:3">chah lowkchow kowi u-pa sakrauah mih iawng ang na khai.<verse eid="PRO 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 4:4" />Nakhowk khe apa tüngsang ang se tek ang mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:4">“En kowh sak maiow hown ang kowh laiklow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:4">ang kowh ana pek chün diah, nahanow en nasing reng kown.<verse eid="PRO 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 4:5" />Chanlaira hai aiung angak tukra krawi cham reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:5">ang laiklow mih tamata dowi kowi chünah reng diah.<verse eid="PRO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 4:6" />Chanlaira dow hangkow nuata diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:6">Nami dow nalawng en reng kown chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 4:6">Chanlaira dow ngownah reng diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:6">Nami dow naming nakhet en reng kown.<verse eid="PRO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 4:7" />Lowra mih sia lak-e lang pankri mih dow chanlaira chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:7">en kowh uowi mih maten hown krawi kramla prengia diah.<verse eid="PRO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 4:8" />Chanlaira dow lang pankri mih chap iawng tuakah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:8">nahanow nami dow kri kraingma nachang en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 4:8">Chanlaira kowi dow dawiah kaneu diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:8">nahanow nami dow nape en ringkawra kown.<verse eid="PRO 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 4:9" />Nami chanlaira dow en lu kowi kowh napawng iawng naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:9">Nami dow en lu kowi kowh mang lukruk iawng naown kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="PRO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 4:10" />Chapa ow, ang laiklow sünta hanow sak kowi towah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:10">nahanow chowngdawng sakklangma en nauowi kown.<verse eid="PRO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 4:11" />Chanlaira tia ang tüngla en mih chowbowt chaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:11">tiama atengma kowi ang kruila en mih chowbowt chaw.<verse eid="PRO 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 4:12" />En cham mang cham kat khe tawngpaw nahang en kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:12">now en cham iowm khe paw en nacham tatheu kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PRO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 4:13" />Ang kowh prengia pek dow dowkta hüah diah, hangkow plawtta khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:13">Nami dow en kowh chownglawng iung müa chekhai rakowi khetah kaneu diah.<verse eid="PRO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 4:14" />Maru ngakuüa mangra tiama kowi hangkow tawi chawp diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:14">amatni changah mih lup iawng hangkow tawi chang diah.<verse eid="PRO 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 4:15" />Naiawng mih maru-uüa mangah mih tiama dow riata reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:15">naiawng mih maru-uüa mangah mih tiama dow hang tawi chawp diah.<verse eid="PRO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 4:16" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru ngakuüa dow chang lup ngak dowi hanow tamüi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:16">maru kowi cham changla angak dowi matchang maru ngakuüa dow müi rau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 4:17" />Naiawngün maru-uüa tut-e dow lup ngak chang mih chakkham iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:17">maru kowi chang nowng chang powng mih dow amatni kowh arak chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 4:18" />Nachenganchepaw achi anawmma miuüa kowh tiama dow rau-e kowh sat nowi iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:18">Nami dow sat downg dowi mowr uang nowi ngamlam mih sat nowi iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 4:19" />Maru ngakuüa kowh tiama dow aiiuma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:19">amatni dow tawng mih kowi chow natatheu kown mih tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 4:20" />Chapa ow, ang laiklow prakowi pe ching diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:20">ang tek en mih prakowi pe param reng diah.<verse eid="PRO 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 4:21" />Nami laiklow dow tawng khe paw hangkow tamata diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:21">Nami dow en sak lak kowi atungma towah reng diah.<verse eid="PRO 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 4:22" />Ang kowh laiklow dow maru-uüa kowi pe singra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:22">ang kowh laiklow dow maru-uüa kowi pe buk iung kow iungra reng.<verse eid="PRO 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 4:23" />Bowkbowk lak-e en kowh saktuak kowi mih lang ming lang khetah rowt diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:23">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh saktuak iawng en kowh chownglawng en sunah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 4:24" />Anowm nadowi mih laiklow mapaw hang tek diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:24">en nawr hownia lai ngak mih hangkow pe lawtah diah.<verse eid="PRO 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 4:25" />En kowh mik mih pur prakowi atengma pacham mü reng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:25">en kowh mik mük mih pur prakowi anikma towah reng diah.<verse eid="PRO 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 4:26" />En kowh khawk en sanah dowi rawn tauakah kaneu diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:26">nahanow en kowh tiama thaulangma naown kown towbowt.<verse eid="PRO 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 4:27" />Tiama nowm hownia hawmlawm pra hai lakuai prakowi hang cham süt diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 4:27">angak hownia en kowh khawk mih alakma towah reng diah.<verse eid="PRO 4:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PRO 5" />
  <para style="s">Chang iang mih hownia uowi kaneu kown mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 5:1" />Chapa ow, ang tekah mih chanlaira lai sünta kaneu diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:1">prengia lai ang tek mih kowi pe ching diah.<verse eid="PRO 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 5:2" />Nahanow tawng mih chow na mih en natuk kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:2">now en nawr hownia tukra laiklow nalawt reng kown towbowt.<verse eid="PRO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 5:3" />Chang iang mih masiuüa kowh laiklow dow kuai tui iawng adingma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:3">iang chang mih masiuüa kowh laiklow dow sau lak-e khowm lang klai chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 5:4" />Nachenganchepaw naiawngün laiklow dow achur khe mih akhakma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:4">naiawngün laiklow dow bürdawng saidawng iawng achukma chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 5:5" />Naiawng mih masiuüa dow kowngra prakowi atengma mang mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:5">Naiawng rakowi naiawng mih masiuüa dow kowngra prakowi napawla en kown.<verse eid="PRO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 5:6" />Amatni dow singra tia prakowi namang kown mih tuak khowm hing tuak dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:6">amatni dow amatni kowh tiama atawima pami tuk khowm hing tuk büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 5:7" />Chapa ow, ang kowh laiklow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:7">ang tek en mih laiklow hangkow tamata diah.<verse eid="PRO 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 5:8" />Naiawng mih masiuüa hownia dow alakma uowiah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:8">naiawng mih masiuüa kimplawt re-e khowm hang cham kowi diah.<verse eid="PRO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 5:9" />En che cham kowi hanow en kowh ringkawra natama kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:9">now maru ngakuüa rut kowi en nalüa kowng kown.<verse eid="PRO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 5:10" />Nahanow en kowh dawngthawnguan dow en tukah dowi miuüa nata powngta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:10">en kowh kawm rak dow akeng mih maru-uüa rut kowi nacham ta powt kown towbowt.<verse eid="PRO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 5:11" />En dow phangbek kowi mawk iowklowk se en nachawng kowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:11">en kowh buk hai nga dow piak rürü rakowi en nanguk runrun kown.<verse eid="PRO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 5:12" />Nakhowk khe en natek kown mih, “Uh! Maiawng ang own mih ang chün lai dowi kowh lowmow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:12">pring ang hawi ang mih laiklow kowi ang nüah klowkah dowi kowh lowmow.<verse eid="PRO 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 5:13" />Tüngsang ang miuüa kowh laiklow ang sünta dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:13">tüngsang ang miuüa tek ang mih prakowi ang pe ching dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 5:14" />Naiawng rakowi kawmat dow ang piak mih chowbowt lowmow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:14">maru kawmuüa pur kowi ang ka rukrai mih chowbowt lowmow,” napa kown.<verse eid="PRO 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kowmatia masi hown napiaw kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 5:15" />En matia masi tut-e kaah sakowmma hown uowiah reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:15">en matia kowh masi lowk iachow kowi phai sakrauah reng diah.<verse eid="PRO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 5:16" />Akeng mih masiuüa hown kowh en cham kaah mih chah dow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:16">en vüi tawngpaw mrawkra nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="PRO 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 5:17" />En kowh chauüa dow en malowkchow kowh pachowng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:17">en chauüa dow hang pacham chowng iang chah lah.<verse eid="PRO 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 5:18" />Naiawng rakowi en chawngah mih masi hown apiawma uowi reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:18">piawra dow en chawngah mih masiuüa hown phai krawi cham rowt diah.<verse eid="PRO 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 5:19" />Sakraura hai klangiungra atekma mih en masi luk kowi sak-ih reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:19">aia dow aia kowh sakraura hown atungma pacham pe en sak-ihra reng lah.<verse eid="PRO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 5:20" />Chapa ow, tawng rakowi chow akeng mih masiuüa kowi en cham sakrau?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:20">Tawngplawng kowchow maru masi hown en nacham taphua taiua kown?<verse eid="PRO 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 5:21" />Lusa maru kowh chowm krang uowi krang dow CHAKRAMANG tang mü reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:21">aia dow lusa maru kowh chowm krang uowi krang maten tuk bowk chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 5:22" />Maru ngakuüa dow amatni kowh lup ngak rakowi kla phih reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:22">maru ngakuüa dow amatni kowh angak leng kowi cham tasowk reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 5:23" />Amatni dow pringhawira ka dowi rakowi kowng reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 5:23">amatni dow <char style="w">buala</char> lai rakowi tiama tawi kowi mang mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 5:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PRO 6" />
  <para style="s">Abualama nauowi dowi kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 6:1" />Chapa ow, en klowkchak kowh lowi pawkra kowi en cham tawi takak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:1">Aia nowng thaw dowi khe en nathaw pe kown mih en tawi takham bow?<verse eid="PRO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 6:2" />Naiawng en tawi tekta mih rakowi en tawi tauowk bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:2">En tawi takhamta mih rakowi en tawi takhuowk bow?<verse eid="PRO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 6:3" />Chapa ow, naiawng now en kla phih mih chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:3">Naiawng rakowi kowmatia kowi talawng müa maiawng chang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 6:3">Aia tut-e kowkowi hanow kowkhamsum kowkhamdaw diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:3">en khamta mih lai napiakta kownkow kowdowk khawk hanow kowtek pe rengreng diah.<verse eid="PRO 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 6:4" />Naiawng chang dowi matchang hang müi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:4">tanai kownkow hang beng mik diah.<verse eid="PRO 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 6:5" />Chakmit mih hownia naki hai uakling uaber powt iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:5">en paw en cham takhuowkra hownia powt diah.<verse eid="PRO 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 6:6" />Silik mih dow lowng uowi krang pacham tasang lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:6">amatni kowh lup hownia pacham paw chanlaira lah.<verse eid="PRO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 6:7" />Amatni kowh dow mang paw uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:7">maru iuk hai kruitown mih paw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 6:8" />Nachenganchepaw amatni dow satma khin khe krüm chakkham reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:8">chungrau khin khe kowh vüi nung chakkham büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 6:9" />Silik la ow, mün khowt tak chow en namüi kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:9">Tawng khe chiang chow en narü amüi kown?<verse eid="PRO 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 6:10" />En tek mih, “Müi nawngchow tak, müi rau reng tak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:10">mawk se em rut nawngchow tak,” pakhai.<verse eid="PRO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 6:11" />Naiawng che chang reng now alinlanma en nangarai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:11">damra thowkta kung kowi ta ngarai mih iawng en naphaw kown.<verse eid="PRO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 6:12" />Suiiai kaniaima mih hai angakma mih maru dow maiawng:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:12">Aia dow krawi tek dai lai reng.<verse eid="PRO 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 6:13" />Aia dow kuan maru khe krawi klip mik reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:13">aia dow kuan maru khe rut khawk ün tüng reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 6:14" />Aia dow saktuak ngak hown thawp sangkrangra ngak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:14">aia dow maru kowi krawi towk ran reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 6:15" />Naiawng rakowi aia luk kowi dow linlanma phih nauang kla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:15">aia dow linlanma napiak hanow nami hownia naiung kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PRO 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 6:16" />Thurai suiah mih maru uowi ranit chaing chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:16">aia tut-e suiiai kaniaima mih dow maiawngün chekhai:<verse eid="PRO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 6:17" />Chang bawri mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:17">tek dai lai mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:17">angak uowi dowi mih maru kowi sai mih,<verse eid="PRO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 6:18" />angak tuak kangowh mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:18">lup ngak chang kowi powt towlow mih,<verse eid="PRO 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 6:19" />Thuak dai lai saksi mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:19">now tainau-uüa kowi towk ran mih maru chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Iang chang hownia nauowi kaneu kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 6:20" />Chapa ow, en pa kowh ana pek chün diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:20">en u tüngsang en mih hangkow tamata diah.<verse eid="PRO 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 6:21" />Nami dow en sak kowi atungma towah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:21">en natukla reng kownkow ngawng kowi ü-ah diah,<verse eid="PRO 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 6:22" />Nami dow en cham kowi khe natüng en tiama kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:22">en müi mih khin khe nachawng en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:22">en thowr müi mih khin khe nape en prengia kown.<verse eid="PRO 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 6:23" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow u-pa kowh ana pek dow maibu iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:23">u-pa kowh pringhawi laiklow dow anowi iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 6:23">Amatni dow naiungla kownkow hawi reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:23">Nami dow chownglawng kowi phawla müa chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 6:24" />Naiawngün dow masiuüa ngak hownia nalawng en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:24">lai ding lai sau hown angak pra napawla en kown mih masiuüa hownia nahen en kown.<verse eid="PRO 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 6:25" />Masiuüa klangiung kowi hangkow ir diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:25">aia kowh sakkraira atekma mih mik mük kowi hang pe ching diah.<verse eid="PRO 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 6:26" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow nga chawkkrawma hanow en nangarai kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:26">Tawkche maru masi hown chang iang hanow en kowh chownglawng natama kown.<verse eid="PRO 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 6:27" />Thung luk kowi en naia tow maih kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:27">En tow e en kowh tawnguat kam dowi tham ü?<verse eid="PRO 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 6:28" />Mairing dawng kowi en naia mang kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:28">En mang e en kowh khawkpha kam dowi tham ü?<verse eid="PRO 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 6:29" />Maru masi hown taphua taiua mih maru dow naiawng napiak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:29">maru masi kowi kak mih maru dow naka ripra ngengche kown.<verse eid="PRO 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="PRO 6:30-31" />Ka dowi rakowi ku mih paw nauowi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:30-31">ka khümta khe dow aia kowi napaw pe iawk ranit phow kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:30-31">aia kim kowi kowh uanh ün napawta pe bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 6:30-31">Aia dow chaah kown mih chakkham uowi dowi rakowi ku mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:30-31">Naiawng rakowi aia kowi mih nakhareah kown nadowi.<verse eid="PRO 6:30-31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 6:32" />Nachenganchepaw chang iang mih dow prengia uowi dowi kowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:32">naiawng aia chang mih dow aiamat lala tapiak mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 6:33" />Aia kowi dow maru napeah rukrai hai nabawpah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:33">aia kowh ming nang ngak dow katpaw tama kown nadowi.<verse eid="PRO 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 6:34" />
    <char style="w">Khowrbown dawma</char> mih hua dow nowm nowm nakunmarau kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:34">amasi hown chang iang mih maru kowi dow aia nasanaah kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:34">nami maru kowi dow aia nasat pe klai kown.<verse eid="PRO 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 6:35" />Tawng iawng mih iawk paw aia napaw kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 6:35">ahuma bümah khowm padow aia mih nasak-ih kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PRO 6:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PRO 7" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 7:1" />Chapa ow, ang kowh laiklow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:1">ang kowh ana pek maten sak kowi towah diah.<verse eid="PRO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 7:2" />Ang kowh ana pek chünah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:2">nahanow en nasing kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 7:2">Ang tüngsang en mih laiklow dow asung uowima.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:2">Nami dow en khet mik iawng khetah kaneu diah.<verse eid="PRO 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 7:3" />Nami dow naka tuakla reng kownkow en rutprüm kowi ün tapah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:3">natukla reng kownkow nami dow en sak kowi ruiah diah.<verse eid="PRO 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 7:4" />En sakrau tuamow iawng chanlaira kowi sakrauah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:4">auiua sin kowi en sakrau iawng prengia kowi sakrauah diah.<verse eid="PRO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 7:5" />Nahanow naiawngün dow chang iang mih masiuüa hownia nalawng en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:5">lai ding lai sau hown angak pra napawla en kown mih masiuüa hownia nahen en kown.<verse eid="PRO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iang chang hownia nauowi kaneu kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 7:6" />Akat khe ang kim kowi kowh tawngpawk re-e ang uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:6">nami tawngpawk hownia prang kowi ang iu downg khai.<verse eid="PRO 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 7:7" />Nakhowk khe prengia uowi dowi mih klanguüa hawmh kowi ang khi sangrum khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:7">naiawngün pungmadawng hownia mapaw prengia uowi dowi mih klanguüa ang khi lowk ia.<verse eid="PRO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 7:8" />Aia dow iang chang mih masiuüa kim re-e kowh tiama iawng haimang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:8">aia dow nami iang chang mih masiuüa kim prakowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="PRO 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 7:9" />Nakhowk khe dow sat kup kowh iiu khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:9">uar kowi kowh iiu mih nowm khowk chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 7:10" />Nami khin khe masiuüa uang lawt lowk ia khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:10">nami masiuüa dow nami klanguüa hown uang takrum khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 7:10">Nami masiuüa dow chawkkrawma tawnguat khupma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:10">aia dow chang iang kown mih saktuak kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 7:11" />Aia dow sangching powingia uowi dowi mih masiuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:11">aia dow rukrai uowi dowi mih masiuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:11">kim kowi katpaw uowi phülü dowi mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 7:12" />Aia dow tiama kowi lai, chi kowi lai cham krawi mang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:12">aia dow tiama krum towng kowi hawt pawm kachakuüa reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 7:13" />Aia dow nami klanguüa kowi dowkah now namah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:13">aia dow tawn rukrai dowi kowi nami klanguüa kowi tek pe mih,<verse eid="PRO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 7:14" />“Ani kowh ang changah mih taking tasangra uanap ngar uowi tak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:14">nami uanap ang chang mih dow ang takhamta mih rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 7:15" />Naiawng rakowi en hown nauang takrum kownkow ang uang lawt mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:15">ang krawi cham en hanow ang krumta en khowk.<verse eid="PRO 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 7:16" />Aigupta pren hownia kowh klangiungma mih uanpowngchow hown ang beta phang kaneu khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:16">naiawngün uan dow achaing achaing mih la hown kowh kawngah mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 7:17" />Phangbek dow nam iungma ang changta khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:17">mura, singding pik hai anam iungma mih chap ang theta khowk.<verse eid="PRO 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 7:18" />Chu, uar thowi pat achi taphua taiua diah sik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:18">asowrma achi taiua uowi diah sik.<verse eid="PRO 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 7:19" />Kim kowi ang hua uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:19">alakma kowi aia cham kowi khari khai.<verse eid="PRO 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 7:20" />Aia dow pawla tangka pa-im khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:20">lacher khe chiang nauang mang kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="PRO 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 7:21" />Nami masiuüa dow klanguüa nautala iawng tek pe hanow ia kuanta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:21">lai ding lai sau hown aia dow angak prakowi nami klanguüa kowi ia pawla khai.<verse eid="PRO 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 7:22" />Nahanow aia kung kowi nami klanguüa dow kowtawi khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:22">Nami dow angenra prakowi chia kowkowi khe kowh iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 7:22">Aia dow leng kowi tasowk mih naki iawng,<verse eid="PRO 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 7:23" />salangba sek hown maru ap-ah now kowng khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 7:23">Uakling uaber dow alenma cham iow hanow powk kowi cham taia reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:23">nami iawng dow nami klanguüa paw aia nakowng kown mih tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 7:24" />Chapa ow, kawmat ang laiklow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:24">ang tek mih kowi pe ching diah.<verse eid="PRO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 7:25" />Naiawng mih masiuüa kowi hangkow nau diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:25">aia tut-e hangkow kowi diah.<verse eid="PRO 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 7:26" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia krawi piakta mih maru dow akawmma khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:26">aia rakowi maru kowng mih akawmma khowk chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 7:27" />Aia kowh kim dow kowngra tiama chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 7:27">nami tiama dow kowngra kowi towm müa chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 7:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PRO 8" />
  <para style="s">Chanlaira hownia kowh prasi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 8:1" />Chanlaira kowh hawk klow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:1">tukra kowh hek klow sünta diah.<verse eid="PRO 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 8:2" />Prengia iung dow tiakrum kowi ün krawi iowng reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:2">aia dow tiama ria kowi kowh arah lowngma mih kowi krawi iowng reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 8:3" />Aia dow marow pra kowh mangla mih tiama kowi krawi iowng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:3">aia dow tapplawt re-e atünma hek se tek mih,<verse eid="PRO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 8:4" />“Maru-uüa low, ang haw enni mih chowbowt chaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:4">maru maten vüi atünma ang tek khowk chaw.<verse eid="PRO 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 8:5" />Abualama miuüa low, tasang chanlaira büah bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:5">bualama miuüa low, atukma uowi büah bowt.<verse eid="PRO 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 8:6" />Sünta, pankrima mih laiklow ang natek kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:6">anowmma mih laiklow ang naprow kown.<verse eid="PRO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 8:7" />Lai ching ang natek kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:7">dai lai kowi dow ang sui chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 8:8" />Ang tekah mih dow anowmma kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:8">Nami dow dai lai nadowi, takuan lai paw nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 8:9" />“Chanlaima miuüa tut-e ang kowh laiklow dow aprawngma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:9">tukra uowi miuüa tut-e naiawngün laiklow mih achimma chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 8:10" />Tai kowi lak-e ang kowh prengia lai kowi lang sakkrai rowt diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:10">achangma mih kuh lak-e paw tukra kowi lang sakkrai rowt diah.<verse eid="PRO 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 8:11" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow chanlaira dow asung uowima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 8:11">Nami dow asung khakma mih hua lak-e paw asung lang uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:11">en nauah mih chap maten lak-e paw asung lang uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 8:12" />“Ang dow chanlaira chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:12">ang tut-e dow prengia uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:12">now ang kowh dow tukra hai tara nowm uowi.<verse eid="PRO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 8:13" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih dow angak kowi sui mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:13">bawri, lowchow, kiang ngak hai dai lai kowi dow ang sui chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 8:14" />Prengia hai chanlaira dow ang hownia kowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:14">tukra hai kürra dow ang chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 8:15" />Manguüa ia kruitown pren mih dow ang khowngah rakowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:15">anowmma mih ari kruitown miuüa ia thawp mih paw ang khowngah rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 8:16" />Kruitown miuüa kruitown pren mih dow ang khowngah rakowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:16">maru iukuüa hai tara chet miuüa ia chet tara mih paw ang khowngah rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 8:17" />“Sakrau ang miuüa kowi dow ang paw sakrauah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:17">sak maiow hown krawi cham ang miuüa dow ka ang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 8:18" />Kurengra hai ringkawra uang ting mih dow ang hownia chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:18">anikma mih dawngthawnguan hai iungra pe mih paw ang chowtaih.<verse eid="PRO 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 8:19" />Ang hownia kowh maratra dow achangma mih kuh lak-e asung lang iung.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:19">Nami dow achangma mih tai lak-e paw asung lang uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 8:20" />Ang dow achinawmma mih tiama kowi mang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:20">tara nowm tiama kowi mang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 8:21" />Sakrau ang miuüa kowi dow ang peah dawngthawnguan reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:21">amatni kowh dawngthawnguan nungra dow atekma ang chang pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 8:22" />“Achük alai khe CHAKRAMANG dow rik thawp ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:22">Nami khin khe aia dow tawng iawng mih uanh paw thawp dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 8:23" />Aia dow achük alai hownia rik thawp ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:23">Nami khin khe dow lusa khowm thawpah dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 8:24" />Ang dia mih khin khe dow sata ün uowi dowi tak.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:24">Nakhowk khe dow tui hawr klunglung mih aw ün uowi dowi tak.<verse eid="PRO 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 8:25" />Ang dia khe dow hungh ün thawpah dowi tak.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:25">Nami khin khe dow chut ün thawpah dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 8:26" />Nami khin khe dow CHAKRAMANG thawp lusa dowi tak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:26">dowm hai dinchow ün paw thawpah dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 8:27" />“Aia dow kuang mih anikma thawpah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:27">Nakhowk khe nami re-e ang tawi uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 8:27">Aia dow sata hai mukuang mih ak-ah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:27">Nakhowk khe paw nami re-e ang tawi uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 8:28" />Aia dow kuang kowi tow pe uangnim khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:28">Nami khin khe paw nami re-e ang tawi uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 8:28">Aia dow krawng dawng kowi tuikuam ün thawpah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:28">Nami khin khe paw nami re-e ang tawi uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 8:29" />Aia dow sata tui vüi thawp pe rihi khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:29">Nami khin khe paw nami re-e ang tawi uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 8:29">Aia dow lusa mih anikma naia uowila kownkow tow pe achüng khai,<verse eid="PRO 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 8:30" />nami khin khe paw uanthawp sara iawng aia re-e ang tawi uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 8:30">Ang rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow ni towng awmrawm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:30">aia pur kowi dow atungma ang piaw reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 8:31" />Aia thawpah mih lusa hown ang awmrawm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:31">lusa maru-uüa hown paw ang piaw reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 8:32" />“Naiawng rakowi chapa ow, kawmat ang laiklow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:32">ang tiama kowi mang miuüa dow iungra naka kown.<verse eid="PRO 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 8:33" />Ang kowh tüngsangra sünta diah, hangkow tamata diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:33">nahanow en nachanlai kown towbowt.<verse eid="PRO 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 8:34" />“Ang kowh laiklow chün mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:34">ang kimbüng re-e ni towng uang uowi reng mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:34">ang kimplawt re-e uang chawng reng miuüa dow prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 8:35" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ka ang mih dow naka singra kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:35">aia dow CHAKRAMANG hownia saksing sanara naka kown.<verse eid="PRO 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PRO 8:36" />Tawkche ka ang dowi mih dow kowmatia kowi tapiak mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 8:36">sui ang miuüa dow nau kowng miuüa chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="PRO 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PRO 9" />
  <para style="s">Chanlaira kowh lup</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 9:1" />Chanlaira dow aiamat vüi thawp kim khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:1">aia dow hua huiia hown thawp pe chüng ranit klüng khai.<verse eid="PRO 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 9:2" />Aia dow ngen tawncher hanow eng chaknga khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:2">grep tui kowi dow nam iungma mih chap aia phiowla pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 9:2">Naiawngün dow pawitang kowi aia thenah khai.<verse eid="PRO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 9:3" />Aia dow nakrawi haw maru-uüa kownkow anarmauüa kowi cham chinah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:3">aia dow marow kowi kowh arah lang lowng mih hownia krawi haw maru mih,<verse eid="PRO 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 9:4" />“Abualama miuüa low, mami re-e uang büa diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:4">Prengia uowi dowi miuüa kowi aia tek pe mih,<verse eid="PRO 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 9:5" />“Uang büa diah, ang kowh chakkham uang cha diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:5">nam iungma mih chap hown ang phiowah mih grep tui uang kham diah.<verse eid="PRO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 9:6" />Abualama miuüa hown hang taiua diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:6">tukra tiama kowi mang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:6">nahanow en nasing kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="PRO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 9:7" />Khare dawma mih maru kowi hawi mih dow ka rukrai reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:7">maru ngak kowi tüng pe atawi mih dow tawi ka ngak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 9:8" />Khare dawma mih maru kowi hangkow tüng pe atawi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:8">en che tüng pe atawi hanow aia dow nasui en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 9:8">Chanlaima mih maru kowi tüng pe atawi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:8">nahanow aia dow nasakrau en kown.<verse eid="PRO 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 9:9" />Chanlaima mih maru kowi sangah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:9">nahanow aia mih nalang chanlai ngamlam kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 9:9">Thurai kowi ringkaw mih maru kowi tüngsangah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:9">nahanow aia mih nalang tuk ngamlam kown.<verse eid="PRO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 9:10" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih dow uown ka chanlaira mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:10">Chimsaima mih Thurai kowi tuk mih dow tukra uowi mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 9:11" />Prengia iung hownia akrama en nasing kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:11">chowngdawng sakklangma en nasing kown.<verse eid="PRO 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 9:12" />En che chanlai khai hanow en kowh chanlaira dow en iung müa chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:12">now en che krawi khare khai hanow nami dow en matia tatowk kawm mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Prengia uowi dowi mih kowh lup</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 9:13" />Bualama mih maru dow taran dawma mih masiuüa iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:13">aia dow aiamat buala mih tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 9:14" />Aia dow aia kimplawt re-e chowm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:14">marow kowi kowh arah lang lowng mih kowi chowm reng.<verse eid="PRO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 9:15" />Nami tiama iawng mang miuüa kowi dow aia krawi hawah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:15">chowlowkkow lup nachang kownkow nami tiama iawng mang miuüa kowi aia krawi tek pe mih,<verse eid="PRO 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 9:16" />“Abualama miuüa low, mami re-e uang büa diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 9:16">Prengia uowi dowi miuüa kowi aia tek pe mih,<verse eid="PRO 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 9:17" />“Cham kuah mih tui dow lang ding,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:17">cham kuah mih chakkham dow asowr lang uowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="PRO 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 9:18" />Tawkche nami masiuüa kim kowi kowkowi miuüa dow amatni nakowng kown mih tuk dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 9:18">nami masiuüa tut-e uang miuüa kowh uowi rah dow krawng dawng kowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 9:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PRO 10" />
  <para style="s">Sawlawmawn kowh chanlai lawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 10:1" />Mami dow Sawlawmawn kowh chanlai lawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PRO 10:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 10:1">Chanlaima mih chauüa rakowi dow u-pa ka awmrawmra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:1">Tawkche bualama mih chauüa rakowi dow u-pa kawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 10:2" />Angak changra hownia kaah mih dawngthawnguan dow tawngpaw mrawkra uowi dowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:2">Tawkche Thurai kowi ringkawra dow kowngra hownia ka lawngra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 10:3" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowi ringkaw miuüa kowi akhawr hown towah dowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:3">Tawkche maru ngakuüa kowh sak naura dow aia pe tachiah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 10:4" />Silikma mih maru dow ngarai reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:4">Tawkche aklumma mih maru dow kureng reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 10:5" />Chanlaima mih maru dow luprak ngen khin khe kua luprak reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:5">Tawkche luprak ngen khin khe müi phülü mih maru dow ka rukrai reng.<verse eid="PRO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 10:6" />Achinawmma miuüa dow ka prasi reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:6">Tawkche maru ngakuüa dow amatni kowh saktuak ngak mih dai lai hown petah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 10:7" />Achinawmma mih maru kowi dow kowng kung kowi paw maru ta tuakah reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:7">maru ngakuüa kowi dow kowng khowk hanow maru tamata reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 10:8" />Chanlaima mih maru dow ana pek kowi pe ching reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:8">now bualama mih maru dow tek naklak rakowi napiak kown.<verse eid="PRO 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 10:9" />Anowmma mih maru dow thaulangma nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:9">Tawkche chang lup ngak mih maru kowi dow maru nakhümah kown.<verse eid="PRO 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 10:10" />Kuan maru kownkow klip mik mih maru dow towk krat reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:10">Tawkche bualama mih maru dow tek naklak rakowi napiak kown.<verse eid="PRO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 10:11" />Achinawmma mih maru kowh laiklow dow tui iawng pe singra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:11">Tawkche maru ngakuüa dow sai maru kown mih tuak laiklow hown petah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 10:12" />Tasuira dow taranra chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:12">Tawkche sakraura dow angak maten lawt reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 10:13" />Aiung angak tukra uowi mih maru tut-e dow ka chanlaira reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:13">prengia uowi dowi mih maru dow ka ripra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 10:14" />Chanlaima mih maru dow krüm tukra ngamlam chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:14">bualama mih maru dow tek naklak rakowi kla phih reng.<verse eid="PRO 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 10:15" />Kurengma mih maru dow aia kowh dawngthawnguan hown nowng talawng reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:15">ngaraima mih maru dow dawngthawnguan uowi dowi rakowi piak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 10:16" />Achinawmma uowi miuüa kowh dow chownglawng iungma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:16">Tawkche chang lup ngak miuüa kowh chownglawng kowi dow ripra uang ting reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 10:17" />Pringhawi khe kowh sünta mih maru dow chownglawng kowi naiung kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:17">Tawkche hawi khe kowh sünta dowi mih maru dow nakla phih kown.<verse eid="PRO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 10:18" />Sui saktuak petah mih maru dow dailama chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:18">khare dawma mih maru dow bualama chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 10:19" />Pawpan hu lai now angak lawt reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:19">Tawkche prengiama mih dow lai marai dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 10:20" />Achinawmma miuüa kowh laiklow dow achangma mih tai iawng asung khakma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:20">chang lup ngak miuüa kowh saktuak dow asung uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 10:21" />Achinawmma miuüa kowh laiklow dow maru akawmma kowi pe maratra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:21">now bualama miuüa dow prengia uowi dowi rakowi kowng reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 10:22" />Thurai peah prasi mih maru dow kureng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:22">nami prasi kowi dow akawm akratra uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 10:23" />Bualama miuüa dow lup ngak chang kowi ka sowr reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:23">Tawkche prengia uowima miuüa dow ka chanlaira mih kowi ka sowr reng.<verse eid="PRO 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 10:24" />Achinawmma miuüa dow amatni sak nau iawng naka kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:24">chang lup ngak miuüa luk kowi dow amatni kramah mih nauang ting kown.<verse eid="PRO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 10:25" />Liku uang hanow maru ngak dow natama kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:25">Tawkche achinawmma mih maru dow athaulangma nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="PRO 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 10:26" />Silikma mih dow pe changah lup mih maru kowi towk kawm reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:26">nami dow kham tui sur khe kowh asowr ngakma mih iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:26">now maih khü mik khe kowh bowm mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 10:27" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih dow chowngdawng sakklangma nasing kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:27">Tawkche maru ngakuüa kowh chownglawng dow natownta pe kown.<verse eid="PRO 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 10:28" />Achinawmma miuüa kowh dow sakowmra kowi awmrawmra uowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:28">maru ngakuüa kowh dow sakowmta iawng katpaw phaw dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 10:29" />CHAKRAMANG kowh tiama dow achinawmma miuüa vüi akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:29">Tawkche nami tiama dow chang ngak mih maru-uüa vüi piakra chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 10:30" />Achinawmma miuüa dow thaulangma nauowi reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:30">now maru ngakuüa dow pren kowi naia uowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="PRO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 10:31" />Achinawmma miuüa dow chanlaira laiklow tek reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:31">Tawkche tek dai lai miuüa kowi dow Thurai nape tekah lai kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PRO 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 10:32" />Achinawmma miuüa dow taka mih laiklow tuk tek reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 10:32">Tawkche maru ngakuüa dow lai ngak chowtaih tek reng.<verse eid="PRO 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PRO 11" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 11:1" />Kuanla maru mih set tawng mih maru kowi dow CHAKRAMANG suiah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:1">Tawkche athikma mih set tawng mih maru kowi dow CHAKRAMANG sak-ihah reng.<verse eid="PRO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 11:2" />Bawrira dow achur khe maru kowi pe rukraira reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:2">now khamsum khamdaw mih dow ka chanlaira reng.<verse eid="PRO 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 11:3" />Anowmma mih maru-uüa kowi dow amatni kowh lup nowm kruitownah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:3">Tawkche kaah sakowm dowi mih maru-uüa dow amatni kowh kiang ngak rakowi piak reng.<verse eid="PRO 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 11:4" />Thurai kunmaraura ni uang ting khe dow dawngthawnguan mih tawngpaw tawi tauang dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:4">achinawmma mih chownglawng dow kowngra hownia maru kowi lawngah reng.<verse eid="PRO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 11:5" />Aiungma mih maru kowi dow tachi tanawmra mih tiama atengma chang pe reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:5">Tawkche maru ngakuüa dow amatni kowh angak changra hownia piak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 11:6" />Achinawmma mih maru-uüa kowi dow amatni tachi tanawmra mih lawngah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:6">Tawkche kaah sakowm dowi miuüa dow amatni kowh lawphara kowi cham takhuowk reng.<verse eid="PRO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 11:7" />Maru ngak kowh dow kowng now aia kowh sakowmra paw tawi piak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:7">now dawngthawnguan luk kowi kowh aia kowh sakowmra paw tawi piak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 11:8" />Achinawmma mih maru dow akrat pusara hownia ka lawngra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:8">Tawkche nami akrat pusara mih maru ngakuüa luk kowi uang kla reng.<verse eid="PRO 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 11:9" />Thurai kowi ringkaw dowi mih maru dow aia kowh nawr hown klowkchakuüa kowi piakah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:9">Tawkche Thurai kowi ringkaw mih maru dow aia kowh tukra hownia ka lawngra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 11:10" />Thurai kowi ringkaw miuüa ka iungra khe marow kowi kowh maru-uüa awmrawm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:10">now maru ngakuüa tut-e piakra uang ting khe paw maru kawmuüa awmrawm kowh how reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 11:11" />Maru iunguüa dow marow vüi prasira chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:11">Tawkche maru ngakuüa laiklow hown marow piak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 11:12" />Kowmatia klowkchak kowi nü dowi klowk dowi mih maru dow prengia uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:12">Tawkche aiung angak tukra uowi miuüa dow aia kowh nawr mih khetah kaneu reng.<verse eid="PRO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 11:13" />Prawng maru reng mih maru dow itah kown mih laiklow paw phuangta reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:13">kaah sakowm mih maru dow itah mih chap kowi krawi phuang dowi.<verse eid="PRO 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 11:14" />Aiungma mih kruitown mih khawr rakowi chenchapuüa sum reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:14">prengia pek mih akawmma now chenchapuüa ka lawngra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 11:15" />Tukah dowi mih maru kowh lowi thawk tawi takham mih maru dow nakawm ngengche kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:15">Tawkche naiawng cham tawi takham dowi mih maru dow <char style="w">thaulang</char> reng.<verse eid="PRO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 11:16" />Chowm krang uowi krang iungma mih masiuüa dow ka ringkawra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:16">Tawkche maru bawp dawma miuüa dow dawngthawnguan chowtaih ka reng.<verse eid="PRO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 11:17" />Saksing sana maru mih dow kowmatia iung müa thawp mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:17">now saksing sana maru dowi mih dow kowmatia piak müa chang mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 11:18" />Maru ngakuüa kramah mih dawngthawnguan dow kham dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:18">Tawkche chang kawngmu lup miuüa dow akhamma mih awmrawm sung ka reng.<verse eid="PRO 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 11:19" />Achi anawmma atungma uowi mih maru dow ka singra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:19">Tawkche angak kowi krawi mih maru dow kowng reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 11:20" />Saktuak ngak atekma mih maru kowi dow CHAKRAMANG sui reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:20">Tawkche achinawmma sun chownglawng mih maru kowi dow aia sak-ih reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 11:21" />Maru ngakuüa dow naka ripra ngengche kown mih enni tuk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:21">now achinawmma miuüa dow tawng iawng mih ripra paw naka kown nadowi.<verse eid="PRO 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 11:22" />Pak param kowi ü pe kuh ramseng chepaw pak tut-e dow tawngpaw asung uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:22">nami iawng apowm klangiungma chepaw aiung angak tuk dowi mih masiuüa dow asung uowi dowi.<verse eid="PRO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 11:23" />Achinawmma mih maru kowh sak naura hownia dow iungra uang ting reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:23">Tawkche maru ngakuüa sak naura hownia dow maru kunmaraura uang ting reng.<verse eid="PRO 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 11:24" />Ngan dowi kowi pe miuüa dow peta mih lak-e ka reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:24">Tawkche tating tataing iawng pe kown nau dowi miuüa dow khawr reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 11:25" />Ngan dowi kowi pe mih maru dow iuksown reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:25">maru kowi pe duah mih maru dow aia paw du reng.<verse eid="PRO 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 11:26" />Asung khakma khe sumah kownkow lawt luprak dowi mih kowi dow maru peah piati reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:26">Tawkche asung tanchow chepaw sum luprak mih maru kowi dow maru peah prasi reng.<verse eid="PRO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 11:27" />Aiung cham mih maru dow ka saksing sanara reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:27">Tawkche angak cham mih maru luk kowi dow angak uang ting reng.<verse eid="PRO 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 11:28" />Dawngthawnguan luk kowi neplawng nesak mih maru dow singh ram min iawng dowh reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:28">Tawkche achinawmma mih maru dow asingma mih singh ram iawng uowi reng.<verse eid="PRO 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 11:29" />Kowmatia kimchak luk kowi uang pawla kratra mih maru kowh dow achur kowi tawngpaw nauowi kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:29">now bualama mih maru-uüa dow chanlaima miuüa kowh nar nachowng kown.<verse eid="PRO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 11:30" />Achinawmma mih maru dow pe singra mih singh iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:30">chanlaima mih maru dow maru naukrang iawng tuk uowi rakowi maru nauah reng.<verse eid="PRO 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 11:31" />Achinawmma miuüa dow mami lusa kowi amatni kowh lup sung ka reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 11:31">nami iawng maru ngakuüa paw amatni kowh lup sung naka ngengche kown.<verse eid="PRO 11:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PRO 12" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 12:1" />Pringhawi laiklow kowi chün mih maru dow tukra kowi ngown mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:1">Tawkche pringhawi laiklow kowi sui mih maru dow bualama mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 12:2" />Aiungma mih maru dow CHAKRAMANG hownia ka saksing sanara reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:2">Tawkche chang ngak kown tuak mih maru kowi dow CHAKRAMANG ripah reng.<verse eid="PRO 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 12:3" />Chang ngak mih maru kowh chownglawng dow thaulang dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:3">Tawkche achinawmma mih maru kowh chownglawng dow thaulangma chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 12:4" />Aiungma mih masiuüa dow ahua kowh awmrawmra hai ringkawra chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:4">Tawkche rukrai uowi dowi mih masiuüa dow ahua vüi hut kowi kowh ma ngak iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 12:5" />Achinawmma mih maru-uüa kowh tuak dow anowm atekma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:5">Tawkche maru ngakuüa kowh prengia pek dow limmara kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 12:6" />Maru ngakuüa kowh laiklow dow linlanma sang nowng sai maru chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:6">Tawkche maru iunguüa kowh laiklow dow maru kowi nowng lawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 12:7" />Maru ngakuüa dow kala chu chah dowi kowi lüa kowng reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:7">Tawkche achinawmma mih maru-uüa kowh kimchak dow anikma uowi reng.<verse eid="PRO 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 12:8" />Chanlaima mih maru kowi dow maru kiowah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:8">Tawkche abualama mih maru kowi dow maru nüah klowkah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 12:9" />Kim kowi chakkham uowi dowi matchang chang kureng iow mih lak-e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:9">kureng dowi chepaw tow nar mih maru lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 12:10" />Achinawmma mih maru dow aia kowh tawncher kowi mingah khetah kaneu reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:10">Tawkche maru ngakuüa dow amatni kowh tawncher kowi khowm changah naklak reng.<verse eid="PRO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 12:11" />Kowmatia krawng bawn kowi aklumma chang lup mih maru dow ahuma ka chakkham reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:11">Tawkche asung uowi dowi mih lup kowi pe khin mih maru dow prengia uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 12:12" />Maru ngakuüa dow akeng mih maru ngakuüa cham rupah mih uanh khowm rupta kown nau.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:12">Tawkche achinawmma mih maru-uüa kowh chownglawng dow anikma hai uih pau reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 12:13" />Maru ngak dow aia kowh laiklow ngak hown cham takhuowk reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:13">Tawkche achinawmma mih maru dow kawm kratra hownia plai reng.<verse eid="PRO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 12:14" />Maru dow kowmatia kowh laiklow hownia ka iungra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:14">aia dow aia changah mih lup iawng ka asung reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 12:15" />Bualama mih maru dow aia changah mih lup towbowt na pahai tatuak reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:15">Tawkche chanlaima mih maru dow maru prengia pek laiklow sünta reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 12:16" />Bualama mih maru dow aia kowh kunmaraura tüngta reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:16">Tawkche chanlaima mih maru dow maru nüah klowkah dowi mih laiklow kowi pe ching dowi.<verse eid="PRO 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 12:17" />Anowmma mih maru dow thuak saksi nowm reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:17">Tawkche dailama mih maru dow thuak dai lai saksi reng.<verse eid="PRO 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 12:18" />Tek naklak mih maru kowh laiklow dow saidawng hown sawtah mih iawng maru tut-e rau reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:18">Tawkche chanlaima mih maru kowh laiklow dow maru sak kowi rau mih iungta pe reng.<verse eid="PRO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 12:19" />Lainowm dow chowngchowng saksakma nik reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:19">Tawkche dai lai dow nik dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 12:20" />Maru ngakuüa kowh sak kowi dow krawi kuan maru kown mih saktuak kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:20">Tawkche maru iung müa kowi chang lup mih maru-uüa kowh sak kowi dow awmrawmra uowi reng.<verse eid="PRO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 12:21" />Achinawmma mih maru-uüa chownglawng kowi dow angak uang ting dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:21">Tawkche maru ngakuüa chownglawng kowi dow angakra atekma uang ting reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 12:22" />Tek dai lai mih maru kowi dow CHAKRAMANG suiah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:22">Tawkche kaah sakowm iawng uowi mih maru kowi dow CHAKRAMANG sak-ihah reng.<verse eid="PRO 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 12:23" />Prengia uowima mih maru dow aia kowh tukra mih itah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:23">Tawkche bualama mih maru dow aia kowh bualara krawi phuangah reng.<verse eid="PRO 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 12:24" />Aklumma mih maru dow maru luk kowi chang low reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:24">Tawkche silikma mih maru dow maru krüa kowi uowi reng.<verse eid="PRO 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 12:25" />Saktuak kawm lai now maru kowh awmrawmra piak reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:25">Tawkche süngüra laiklow dow maru kowi pe awmrawm reng.<verse eid="PRO 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 12:26" />Achinawmma mih maru dow aia klowkchakuüa kowi tüng pe tiama nowm reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:26">Tawkche maru ngakuüa dow piakla kown mih tiama kowi mang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 12:27" />Silikma mih maru dow kowmatia chakkham khowm kram kown nau dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:27">Tawkche aklumma mih maru dow achur khe ka dawngthawnguan reng.<verse eid="PRO 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 12:28" />Anowmma mih tiama kowi dow singra uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 12:28">anowmma mih tiama kowi dow kowngra uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 12:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PRO 13" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 13:1" />Chanlaima mih chapa dow u-pa pringhawi laiklow chün reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:1">Tawkche prawngren dawma mih maru dow pringhawi laiklow sünta dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 13:2" />Aiungma mih maru dow kowmatia laiklow iung rakowi ka iungra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:2">Tawkche maru ngak dow nakrawi chang anowng apowng kown mih chowtaih nau reng.<verse eid="PRO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 13:3" />Kowmatia nawr kowi khetah kaneu mih maru dow chowngdawng sakklang reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:3">Tawkche tuakah kaneu dowi kowi tek naklak mih maru dow piak reng.<verse eid="PRO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 13:4" />Silikma mih maru dow ka kown nau chepaw tawngpaw ka dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:4">Tawkche aklumma mih maru dow amatni nauah mih lak-e lang ka reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 13:5" />Achinawmma mih maru dow dai lai kowi sui reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:5">Tawkche maru ngak dow krawi pe rukrai hai ming ngak reng.<verse eid="PRO 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 13:6" />Maru iunguüa kowi dow amatni kowh tachi tanawmra lawngah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:6">Tawkche maru ngakuüa kowi dow amatni kowh angak piakah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 13:7" />Tawngbak mih maru dow tawngpaw uowi dowi chepaw chang kureng iow reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:7">Tawkche tawngbak mih maru dow kurengma chepaw chang ngarai iow reng.<verse eid="PRO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 13:8" />Kurengma mih maru dow kowmatia dawngthawnguan hown talawng takla reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:8">Tawkche ngaraima mih maru kowi dow miapaw krawkah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 13:9" />Achinawmma mih maru-uüa dow anowima mih maibu iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:9">Tawkche maru ngakuüa dow mit kown chowbowt mih maibu iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 13:10" />Bawrira dow thawp takhowk taranra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:10">Tawkche chanlaima miuüa dow maru tut-e krawi paw prengia reng.<verse eid="PRO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 13:11" />Alenma kramah mih tangka dow alenma khowk reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:11">Tawkche akawmma hown kowh kramah mih tangka dow uang pawng ngamlam chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 13:12" />Ka kown sakowmta hüah mih kowi akak kra lai now maru sak piak reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:12">Tawkche sak nau mih sia ka mih maru dow awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 13:13" />Prengia iung kowi nü dowi klowk dowi mih maru dow kowmatia piak müa thawp mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:13">Tawkche prengia iung kowi pe ching mih maru dow ka awmrawm sung reng.<verse eid="PRO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 13:14" />Chanlaima mih maru kowh tüngsangra dow tui iawng pe singra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:14">Nami dow kowngra hownia naplaila kownkow khowng reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 13:15" />Prengia iungma mih maru dow ka ringkawra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:15">Tawkche kaah sakowm dowi mih maru dow piak reng.<verse eid="PRO 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 13:16" />Prengia uowima mih maru dow aia kowh tukra hown chang lup reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:16">Tawkche abualama mih maru kowi dow aia kowh lup hownia abualama pami tukah reng.<verse eid="PRO 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 13:17" />Maru ngakma mih satang phowng mih dow maru kowi krawi towk krat reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:17">Tawkche kaah sakowmma mih satang phowng mih dow maru kowi pe iungra reng.<verse eid="PRO 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 13:18" />Pringhawi laiklow chün dowi mih maru dow khawr hai ka rukraira reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:18">Tawkche pringhawi laiklow chün mih maru dow ka ringkawra reng.<verse eid="PRO 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 13:19" />Sak nau mih sia ka mih maru dow sak-ih reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:19">Tawkche bualama mih maru dow angak hownia tahen kown sui reng.<verse eid="PRO 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 13:20" />Chanlaima mih maru hown taiua mih maru dow tawi chanlai reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:20">Tawkche bualama mih maru hown taiua mih maru dow tawi piak reng.<verse eid="PRO 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 13:21" />Maru ngakuüa kung kowi dow phih tawi krawi reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:21">Tawkche achinawmma mih maru-uüa dow ka iungra reng.<verse eid="PRO 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 13:22" />Aiungma mih maru-uüa dow chu chauüa vüi towla pe dawngthawnguan reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:22">Tawkche maru ngakuüa kowh dawngthawnguan dow achinawmma miuüa vüi ta chowng reng.<verse eid="PRO 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 13:23" />Ngaraima mih maru-uüa paw tawngbak khe dow luprak ahuma ka reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:23">Tawkche naiawngün luprak mih maru ngakuüa rupta pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 13:24" />Kowmatia chah kowi ripah dowi mih maru dow sakrau chah dowi kowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:24">Tawkche kowmatia chah kowi pring hawiah mih maru dow sakrau chah kowh chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 13:25" />Achinawmma mih maru-uüa dow du pat chi ka cha reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 13:25">Tawkche maru ngakuüa dow sakkrai hown uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PRO 14" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 14:1" />Prengia uowima mih masiuüa dow kimchak iuksown müa chang reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:1">Tawkche prengia uowi dowi mih masiuüa dow kimchak piak müa chang reng.<verse eid="PRO 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 14:2" />Anowmma chowm uowi mih dow CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:2">Tawkche anowmma chowm uowi dowi mih maru dow CHAKRAMANG kowi sui chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 14:3" />Abualama mih maru dow aia kowh laiklow rakowi ka ripra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:3">Tawkche chanlaima miuüa dow amatni kowh laiklow hownia ka lawngra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 14:4" />Chiala uowi dowi now pram pek takla dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:4">Tawkche chiala kür hown ahuma ka luprak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 14:5" />Kaah sakowmma mih saksi thuak mih dow tek daila dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:5">Tawkche kaah sakowm dowi mih saksi thuak mih dow tek daila reng.<verse eid="PRO 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 14:6" />Prengia lai kowi küala rensi mih maru dow krawi cham chanlaira chepaw ka dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:6">Tawkche prengia uowima mih maru dow aiachow hown ka tukra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 14:7" />Bualama mih maru hownia dow cham lang powt diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia tut-e dow en naka tukra kown nadowi.<verse eid="PRO 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 14:8" />Tiama iung tiama ngak tuk mat mih maru dow chanlai mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:8">Tawkche abualama mih maru dow amatni lala takuan reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 14:9" />Abualama mih maru dow aia kowh aprek kowi cham küala rensi reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:9">Tawkche achinawmma mih maru dow changta angak now lü lawt reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 14:10" />En kowh sak kawmra dow en matia kowh chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:10">en kowh awmrawmra dow miapaw tawi ia taret dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 14:11" />Maru ngakuüa kowh kim dow napiak reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:11">Tawkche maru iunguüa kowh kim dow naiuk ngamlam kown.<verse eid="PRO 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 14:12" />Maru mih kowmatia mangah mih tiama kowi aiung pahai ka tuak reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:12">Tawkche nami tiama mih kowngra prakowi aia kowi napawla chepaw naia kown.<verse eid="PRO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 14:13" />Ren dow saktuak kawm mih kowi nowng pet chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:13">Tawkche ren chur khe dow sak ngara ta uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 14:14" />Maru ngakuüa dow amatni kowh chowm krang uowi krang sung naka ripra kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:14">Tawkche maru iunguüa dow amatni kowh lup iung rakowi naka awmrawm sung ngengche kown.<verse eid="PRO 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 14:15" />Bualama mih maru dow maru laiklow maten owm reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:15">Tawkche chanlaima mih maru dow taah mih maten tuakah kaneu reng.<verse eid="PRO 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 14:16" />Chanlaima mih maru dow uowi kaneu rakowi angak hownia tala reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:16">Tawkche abualama mih maru dow tuakah kaneu dowi kowi chang lup reng.<verse eid="PRO 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 14:17" />Kunma ngakma mih maru dow abualama mih maru iawng chang lup reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:17">lup ngak chang kowi sangkrang mih maru kowi dow maru maten suiah reng.<verse eid="PRO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 14:18" />Abualama mih maru dow buala sung ka reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:18">Tawkche kaneuma uowi mih maru dow awmrawm sung iawng ka tukra reng.<verse eid="PRO 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 14:19" />Maru ngakuüa dow maru iunguüa pur kowi khamsum khamdaw reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:19">maru ngakuüa dow achinawmma miuüa tut-e krawi khamsum khamdaw reng.<verse eid="PRO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 14:20" />Ngarai miuüa kowi dow klowkchakuüa khowm naukhi-ah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:20">Tawkche kurengma miuüa kowh dow auiua akawmma uowi reng.<verse eid="PRO 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 14:21" />Kowmatia klowkchak kowi sui mih dow chang ngak mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:21">Tawkche khawr miuüa kowi saksing sana mih maru dow ka prasi reng.<verse eid="PRO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 14:22" />Nachang lup ngak kownkow sangkrang miuüa dow piak reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:22">Tawkche chang lup iung kownkow sangkrang miuüa dow owmra hai ringkawra ka reng.<verse eid="PRO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 14:23" />Aklumma changah mih lup maten dow maratra uowi reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:23">Tawkche chang pe lup dowi kowi lai bawklawk mih dow khawr reng.<verse eid="PRO 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 14:24" />Chanlaima miuüa kowh awmrawm sung dow kurengra chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:24">Tawkche bualama miuüa dow buala sung buala ngamlam chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 14:25" />Thuak saksi nowm mih maru dow lawng maru chownglawng reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:25">Tawkche thuak daila saksi mih maru dow maru kowi pe arau reng.<verse eid="PRO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 14:26" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih maru dow ka sakowmra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:26">now aia kowh chauüa paw ka tatung tanimra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 14:27" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih dow tui iawng pe singra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:27">Nami dow nakowng kown mih tiama hownia maru kowi hen reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 14:28" />Maru iun akawmma now mang ka kiowrira reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:28">Tawkche maru iun e lai now mang piak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 14:29" />Kunmarau naklak dowi mih maru dow prengia chakma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:29">Tawkche kunmarau naklak mih maru dow aia kowh bualara tüng mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 14:30" />Saktuak thaulangra dow kow iung müa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:30">Tawkche irsi tuak dow kow nga müa chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 14:31" />Ngaraima mih maru kowi chang nowng mih dow Thurai kowi pe rukrai mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:31">Tawkche khawr mih maru kowi saksing sana mih dow Thurai kowi ringkaw mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 14:32" />Maru ngakuüa dow amatni kowh angak rakowi piak reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:32">Tawkche achinawmma mih maru dow kowng chepaw ka naira reng.<verse eid="PRO 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 14:33" />Prengia uowi mih maru sak kowi dow chanlaira uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:33">Tawkche bualama miuüa dow chanlaira lawnguan kowi tawngpaw tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 14:34" />Thurai kowi ringkawra dow pren kowi pe ringkawra reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:34">tawkche angak dow chenchapuüa kowi pe rukraira reng.<verse eid="PRO 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 14:35" />Chanlaima chang lup mih maru iuk kowi dow aiung hown mang müah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 14:35">Tawkche kala rukrai mih lup chang mih maru iuk kowi dow mang kunmarauah reng.<verse eid="PRO 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PRO 15" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 15:1" />Sangprowk laitek klam now kunmarau prowng reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:1">Tawkche lairang dow towk kunmarau reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 15:2" />Chanlaima mih maru-uüa kowh nawr dow tukra kowi kiowah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:2">Tawkche bualama mih maru nawr hownia dow buala laiklow uang lawt reng.<verse eid="PRO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 15:3" />CHAKRAMANG kowh mik dow lowra re-e krawi uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:3">aia dow maru iung hai maru ngak luk kowi tang mü reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 15:4" />Lai iung dow pe singra mih singh iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:4">Tawkche arangma mih lai dow maru kowi krawi piak sak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 15:5" />Bualama mih maru dow u-pa pringhawi laiklow kowi nü dowi klowk dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:5">Tawkche kaneuma uowi mih maru dow u-pa pringhawi mih laiklow sünta reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 15:6" />Achinawmma mih maru-uüa kim kowi dow dawngthawnguan ahuma uowi reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:6">Tawkche maru ngakuüa kramah mih hownia dow piakra uang ting reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 15:7" />Chanlaima mih maru kowh nawr dow krawi uet tukra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:7">Tawkche bualama mih maru kowh sak dow naiawng nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 15:8" />Maru ngakuüa kowh phuchua dow CHAKRAMANG sui reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:8">Tawkche achinawmma miuüa awr chupah mih dow aia awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 15:9" />Maru ngakuüa kowh tiama dow CHAKRAMANG sui reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:9">Tawkche lup iung chang kowi thüa reng miuüa kowi dow aia sakrauah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 15:10" />Anowmma mih tiama kowi nuata mih maru dow naka ripra kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:10">pringhawi laiklow sünta dowi mih maru dow nakowng kown.<verse eid="PRO 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 15:11" />Kowng miuüa uowi rah pren paw CHAKRAMANG dow khi bowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:11">Naiawng rakowi aia dow maru saktuak ngam padow lang khi tak chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 15:12" />Prawngren dawma mih maru dow pringhawi laiklow nauta dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:12">naiawng mih maru dow chanlaima miuüa tut-e krawi kowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 15:13" />Saktuak sowrchow now lumowr paw chimprowngchow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:13">Tawkche saktuak krat lai now lumowr paw klimthupma chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 15:14" />Prengia uowima miuüa kowh sak dow krawi cham tukra ngamlam chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:14">Tawkche bualama miuüa dow bualama uowi mih kowi sak-ih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 15:15" />Tuak kawm tuak krat miuüa dow ni towng akrat pusara krum reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:15">Tawkche saktuak sowrma miuüa tut-e dow ni towng pawi ni iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 15:16" />Dawngthawnguan huma chepaw thaulangra uowi dowi now tawngpaw mrawk dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:16">nami lak-e a-echow chepaw CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 15:17" />Kurengma mih kim kowi cha chaknga chepaw tasakraura uowi dowi now iung dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:17">Tawkche ngaraima mih kim kowi pram kan chowtaih cha chepaw tasakraura uowi now lang iung.<verse eid="PRO 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 15:18" />Kunma ngakma mih maru dow krawi uown taran reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:18">Tawkche kunmarau naklak dowi mih maru dow prowng taranra reng.<verse eid="PRO 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 15:19" />Silikma mih maru kowh tiama kowi dow chuh atekma uowi reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:19">Tawkche aklumma mih maru kowh tiama dow asaima uowi reng.<verse eid="PRO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 15:20" />Chanlaima mih chauüa dow amatni kowh pa kowi pe awmrawmra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:20">Tawkche bualama mih chauüa dow amatni kowh u kowi sui reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 15:21" />Bualama mih maru dow aia buala mih kowi awmrawmla reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:21">Tawkche chanlaima mih maru dow tiama nowm kowi mang reng.<verse eid="PRO 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 15:22" />Prengia pek mih che khawr now sangkrangta mih iawng lup phaw dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:22">Tawkche prengia pek mih che hu now sangkrangta mih iawng lup phaw reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 15:23" />Maru lünta khe athikma nowng klang mih maru dow maru kowi pe awmrawmra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:23">maru lakke mih khin khe taka mih laiklow tuk tek mih maru dow lainowmma iung.<verse eid="PRO 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 15:24" />Chanlaima mih maru-uüa dow singra tiama kowi mang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:24">amatni dow kowngra tiama kowi mang dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 15:25" />Bawrima mih maru kowh kim dow CHAKRAMANG piakta pe reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:25">Tawkche mamaimowuüa kowh dawngthawnguan dow aia khet pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 15:26" />Angakma mih sangkrangra maten CHAKRAMANG sui reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:26">Tawkche aiungma mih laiklow dow CHAKRAMANG nauta reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 15:27" />Lawphama mih maru dow kimchakuüa luk kowi uang pawla akrat reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:27">Tawkche paw bümsua dowi mih maru dow chowngdawng sakklangma sing reng.<verse eid="PRO 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 15:28" />Achinawmma mih maru dow klang dowi rawn rik tuakah kaneu reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:28">Tawkche maru ngakuüa hownia dow lai ngak mih tui hawr iawng uang lawt reng.<verse eid="PRO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 15:29" />Maru ngakuüa hownia dow CHAKRAMANG mih alakma uowi reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:29">Tawkche achinawmma miuüa kowh prasi lük dow aia hawt sünta pe reng.<verse eid="PRO 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 15:30" />Aiungma mih mik mük dow maru awmrawm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:30">satang iung dow maru kow kowi pe iungra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 15:31" />Singra nakala kownkow pringhawi laiklow sünta mih maru dow chanlaima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:31">aia dow chanlaima mih maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi natawi uowi reng kown.<verse eid="PRO 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 15:32" />Pringhawi laiklow kowi nuata mih maru dow kowmatia kowi nü dowi klowk dowi mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:32">Tawkche pringhawi laiklow kowi sünta mih maru dow ka prengia reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 15:33" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih dow pe chanlaira mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 15:33">ka ringkawra dowi rawn khamsum khamdawra rik uowi kown takla.<verse eid="PRO 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PRO 16" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 16:1" />Lusa maru dow thawp sangkrangra reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:1">Tawkche CHAKRAMANG chowtaih pe phawah reng.<verse eid="PRO 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 16:2" />Maru-uüa dow amatni changah mih lup maten anowmma padow tatuak reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:2">Tawkche CHAKRAMANG dow amatni sak naura nowk pe khai pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 16:3" />CHAKRAMANG kowi owmsakma hown en kowh lup maten changah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:3">nahanow en sangkrangta mih iawng aiungma naphaw kown.<verse eid="PRO 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 16:4" />CHAKRAMANG thawpah mih uanh maten auan uowima kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:4">maru ngak kowi aia towah mih paw piakra uang ting khe napiakta kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 16:5" />Abawrima miuüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG suiah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:5">naiawng mih maru-uüa dow naka ripra ngengche kown mih enni aiawng tuk towbowt.<verse eid="PRO 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 16:6" />CHAKRAMANG luk kowi kaah sakowmma hai anowmma uowiah büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:6">nahanow enni kowh angak dow aia nalawtta enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 16:6">CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kramah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:6">nahanow angak hownia lang tahen büah reng diah.<verse eid="PRO 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 16:7" />CHAKRAMANG sak-ih en iawng uowiah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:7">nahanow en kowh ransu-uüa hown paw athaulangma en naia uowi kown.<verse eid="PRO 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 16:8" />Lup ngak changra hownia dow tangka pawisa ahuma ia ka reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:8">Tawkche tangka pawisa kakra a-echow chepaw chang lup iung mih lang iung rowt chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 16:9" />Lusa maru dow thawp sangkrangra reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:9">Tawkche amatni kowh lup khowm bowk pe mih dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih.<verse eid="PRO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 16:10" />Mang dow Thurai hownia kowh prengia hown chet tara reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:10">aia dow anowm nadowi iawng chet tara dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 16:11" />CHAKRAMANG nau mih dow achima maru nakhai uanh kown mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:11">aia nau mih dow adik chima mih set maru natawng kown mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 16:12" />Mang dow nachang angak kown mih mapaw taka dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:12">Tawngplawng kowchow panow mang chowm rah ia uowi mih dow lup iung chang hown chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 16:13" />Tek lainowm mih maru kowi dow manguüa awmrawmah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:13">tek lai ching mih maru kowi dow manguüa sakrauah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 16:14" />Mang kunmarau now maru kowng ne chepaw naia.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:14">Tawkche chanlaima mih maru dow mang kowi klam pe kunma reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 16:15" />Mang awmrawm mih khin khe dow maru-uüa ka singra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:15">aia kowh sanara dow uang iawng pe singra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 16:16" />Ka kuh mih lak-e ka chanlaira mih lang iung,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:16">ka tai mih lak-e ka prengia mih lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 16:17" />Anowmma mih maru-uüa dow angak hownia lang tahen reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:17">kaneuma chowm uowi miuüa dow aia kowh sak nowng lawng reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 16:18" />Piak dowi rawn dow maru chang bawri reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:18">tim dowi rawn dow maru chang owrow reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 16:19" />Bawrima miuüa hown kür hown cham rupah mih uanh tabak mih lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:19">ngaraima miuüa hown khamsum khamdawma uowi mih lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 16:20" />Thurai laiklow chün mih maru dow ka iungra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:20">CHAKRAMANG luk kowi neplawng nesak mih maru dow prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 16:21" />Chanlaima mih dow aia kowh prengia rakowi ming nang uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:21">tuk tek lai iung mih maru dow maru saktuak akat sang ia chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 16:22" />Prengia uowima mih maru tut-e dow aia kowh prengia mih tui iawng pe singra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:22">Tawkche bualama miuüa kowi dow tüngsangah chepaw mrawkra uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 16:23" />Chanlaima mih maru dow rik tuakah kaneu dowi matchang tek naklak dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:23">Naiawng rakowi aia kowh tüngsangra dow chawn reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 16:24" />Kuai tui dow akham sowrma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:24">now kow vüi paw aiungma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 16:24">Lai iung dow nami kuai tui iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 16:25" />Maru maten dow kowmatia mangah mih tiama kowi aiung pahai ka tuak reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:25">Tawkche nami tiama dow kowngra prakowi aia kowi napawla chepaw naia kown.<verse eid="PRO 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 16:26" />Sakkrai mih maru dow aklumma chang lup reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:26">aia lup chang takla mih dow sakkrai rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 16:27" />Maru ngak dow nachang ngak kownkow sangkrang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:27">aia kowh laiklow dow lün pluplup mih maih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 16:28" />Maru ngak dow krawi towk ran reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:28">prawngren dawma mih maru dow auiua hown tanga reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 16:29" />Chang nowng chang powng mih maru dow a-auiuauüa kowi tüng pe lawphara reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:29">naiawng hai amatni kowi dow angak tia kowi aia pawla reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 16:30" />Krawi klip mik mih maru dow nachang ngak kownkow tuakta hüah chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:30">mak ve mih maru dow nachang lup ngak kownkow kamrütta hüah chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 16:31" />Sam pau dow klangiungma mih mang lukruk iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:31">nami ka mih dow achinawmma uowi rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 16:32" />Kunma thawngma mih maru dow akürma mih maru lak-e lang iung,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:32">nowng town sak mih maru dow nowng powngta marow mih maru lak-e lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 16:33" />Maru-uüa dow kuak plang reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 16:33">Tawkche khowm bowk pe mih dow Thurai chowtaih.<verse eid="PRO 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PRO 17" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 17:1" />Taran urlur mih pawi kim kowi cha chakkham mih lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:1">athaulangma hown kawmpah keu cha asek mih lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 17:2" />Prengia uowima mih nar dow kim iah kowh bualama mih chapa luk kowi chang alow reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:2">aia paw nami kim iah chapauüa kowh dawngthawnguan bak tawi ka powng reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 17:3" />Kuh hai tai kowi dow achangma chünchü mih natukla kownkow maih hown chaingah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:3">nami iawng dow maru kowh saktuak mih CHAKRAMANG chaingah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 17:4" />Maru ngak dow sünta lai ngak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:4">dailama mih maru dow dai lai kowi pe ching reng.<verse eid="PRO 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 17:5" />Ngaraima mih maru kowi khare mih dow aia kowh Thawp Miia kowi peah rukrai mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:5">maru kla phih khe tawi awmrawm mih maru dow naka ripra ngengche kown.<verse eid="PRO 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 17:6" />Chu cheuüa dow lawngtanguüa tut-e mang lukruk iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:6">now chauüa tut-e paw u-pa mih asung uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 17:7" />Abualama mih maru natek lai iung kown mih lahawm dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:7">now maru iuk natek dai lai kown mih paw lahawm dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 17:8" />Tawngbak mih maru dow bümsua kowi maiaklese iawng nüla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:8">bümsua hown dow lowra lup nowng chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 17:9" />Lowkkowlowk angak talawt hanow tasakraura lang hu ngamlam chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:9">Tawkche plau pe angak rengreng hanow auiua tanga reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 17:10" />Prengia uowi mih maru kowi dow hawiah akat now tukta.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:10">Tawkche bualama mih maru kowi dow 100 kat hupah chepaw tukta dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 17:11" />Maru ngak dow kingküa dawma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:11">aia kowi dow rip chamang naripah kown chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 17:12" />Bualama mih maru bualama mih lup chang mih khin khe kowtakrum mih lak-e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:12">chah tama rakowi arangma mih tawmma hown kowtakrum mih lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 17:13" />Chang iung mih maru kowi hangkow changah angak diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:13">chang hanow aia luk kowi dow angak nauang kla kown.<verse eid="PRO 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 17:14" />Uown taran mih dow uown khue tui owng mih iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:14">Naiawng rakowi taüa dowi rawn taingta diah.<verse eid="PRO 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 17:15" />CHAKRAMANG suiah mih maru uowi pre chaing chekhai:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:15">nami dow chang ngak mih maru kowi data pe angak mih maru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:15">now achinawmma mih maru kowi bek pe angak mih maru chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 17:16" />Abualama mih maru nachanlai kownkow khowk pe tangka e tawngpaw maratra uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:16">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowh dow nakala chanlaira kown mih prengia uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 17:17" />Auiua dow lowkkowlowk kowi atungma tasakrau reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:17">now kowmatia tainau dow akrat pusa khe khowng reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 17:18" />Abualama mih maru dow akeng mih maru paw lowi khe tawi takham reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:18">nami maru nowng thaw dowi now aia nathaw kown mih takham reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 17:19" />Angak tuak kangowh mih maru dow taran dawma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:19">bawrima mih maru luk kowi dow piakra uang ting reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 17:20" />Saktuak ngakma mih maru dow ka iungra dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:20">tek dai lai mih maru dow kla phih reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 17:21" />Bualama mih chauüa rakowi dow u-pa kawm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:21">amatni rakowi dow upa-uüa apiawma ka uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 17:22" />Saktuak sowr now kow iung reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:22">Tawkche saktuak pusa now kow nga reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 17:23" />Maru ngak dow ku cha bümsua reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:23">Naiawng rakowi amatni dow tara nowm chet dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 17:24" />Prengia uowi mih maru dow chanlaira prakowi pe ching reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:24">Tawkche abualama mih maru dow tawng mih prakowi paw saktuak nik dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 17:25" />Abualama mih chah rakowi dow a-pa tuak kawm tuak krat reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:25">now aia rakowi dow a-u paw sak piak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 17:26" />Achinawmma mih maru kowi napaw pe aiawk kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:26">anowmma mih maru iuk kowi naia ripah kown nadowi.<verse eid="PRO 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 17:27" />Tukra uowima mih maru dow lai marai dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:27">now kunma klamma mih maru dow prengia uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 17:28" />Bualama mih maru paw lai dowi khe dow chanlaima mih maru iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 17:28">ririmma aia uowi khe aia dow aiung angak tukra uowi mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 17:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PRO 18" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 18:1" />Mia hown paw taklawp taiua dowi mih maru dow kowmatia sak nau iawng chang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:1">aia dow maru sangkrangta kaneu mih lup lawnguan kowi tawi nauta reng dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 18:2" />Abualama mih maru dow aiung angak tuk kown nau dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:2">aia süngür mih dow aia kowh saktuak pe tuk pe ta kown mih krowngchow chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 18:3" />Chang lup ngak mih kowi dow maru suiah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:3">powingia uowi dowi mih kowi dow maru prawng renah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 18:4" />Chanlaima mih maru kowh laiklow dow krawng dawng tui iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:4">krawng dawng tui iawng aia nawr hownia dow chanlaira laiklow uang lawt reng.<verse eid="PRO 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 18:5" />Chang ngak mih maru kowi tangila kown iung dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:5">achinawmma mih maru kowi angakma nachet pe tara kown mih iung dowi.<verse eid="PRO 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 18:6" />Abualama mih maru kowh nawr dow taranra prakowi pawla reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:6">aia dow aia laiklow rakowi cham dang müa reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 18:7" />Abualama mih maru luk kowi piakra uang ting mih dow aia laiklow rakowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:7">aia dow aia laiklow rakowi tauowk reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 18:8" />Taprawng taren mih laiklow dow asowrma mih chakkham iawng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:8">Naiawng rakowi nami dow maru cha kown mih lainowmma nau khai.<verse eid="PRO 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 18:9" />Silik lup chang mih maru dow angakma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:9">aia dow lup ngak chang mih maru hown katsang chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 18:10" />CHAKRAMANG ming dow akhawtma mih kimkrowng iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:10">achinawmma mih maru dow nakowi alenma kowkowi hanow ka lawngra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 18:11" />Kurengma mih dow aia kowh dawngthawnguan hown nowngia talawng pami ka tuak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:11">aia kowh dawngthawnguan kowi dow aia kowh talawng müa tap iawng tuakla khai.<verse eid="PRO 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 18:12" />Piak dowi rawn maru chang bawri reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:12">ka ringkawra dowi rawn maru khamsum khamdaw reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 18:13" />Maru kowh laiklow rik sünta dowi matchang hang klang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:13">naiawng klang mih dow uowiah parukrai hai abualama mih lup chang mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 18:14" />Arau abau uowi khe sakkhawtra uowi khü chiang maru nowng ka iungra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:14">Tawkche sakkhawtra uowi dowi now naiung kown mih sakowmra uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 18:15" />Prengia uowima mih maru kowh sak dow krawi kram tukra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:15">chanlaima mih maru kowh param dow krawi cham tukra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 18:16" />Pankrima mih maru hown takrum kown nau now pawla pe awmrawm sung diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:16">nahanow aia hown nakowtalawp kownkow aia pur kowi naia kowi kown.<verse eid="PRO 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 18:17" />Tara chetra kowi kowmatia lawnguan rik tek khe dow kaah owm iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:17">Tawkche nami maru kowi akeng mih maru uang lüntaah khe dow aia kowh angak tatüng reng chekhai,<verse eid="PRO 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 18:18" />Pankrima mih maru pre ia taran khe kuak pe plang hanow iungra uang ia phaw chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:18">nami plang kowi cha iawng amatchi dow chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 18:19" />Auiua kowi khowngah hanow aia dow akhikhawtma mih tap iawng natowkala en kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:19">Tawkche aia hown che en taran khai hanow aia dow nabüngta en kimplawt kown.<verse eid="PRO 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 18:20" />Lai iung tekra hownia dow maru ka sak-ihra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:20">aia laiklow iawng aia luk kowi uang phaw reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 18:21" />Laiklow rakowi dow sing paw ia sing, kowng paw ia kowng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:21">amatni tekta iawng amatni luk kowi uang phaw reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 18:22" />Ka masi mih maru dow ka prasira khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:22">Nami dow CHAKRAMANG sanara luk hownia kaah mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 18:23" />Ngaraima mih maru dow kurengma mih maru tut-e lü khowng reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:23">Tawkche kurengma mih maru dow peah rukrai se klangah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 18:24" />Auiua nowm dowi mih dow akawmma chepaw piak reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 18:24">Tawkche tawngbak mih auiua dow kowmatia tainau lak-e lang kaah sakowmra chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PRO 19" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 19:1" />Tek dai lai mih abualama mih maru lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:1">anowmma uowi mih ngaraima mih maru lang iung.<verse eid="PRO 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 19:2" />Tukra uowi dowi mih naura dow iung dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:2">chang lup khe sakkrowng lai now lup tawi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 19:3" />Tawngbak mih maru dow aia buala lai rakowi piak reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:3">Tawkche aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowi sak-hiah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 19:4" />Kurengma mih maru dow ka auiua sar reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:4">Tawkche ngaraima mih maru kowi dow auiuauüa nuata reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 19:5" />Thuak dai lai saksi mih maru dow naka ripra ngengche kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:5">Tawkche tek dai lai mih saksi dow naia plai kown nadowi.<verse eid="PRO 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 19:6" />Maru iukuüa hownia kala khowng kownkow maru tow auiua reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:6">pe awmrawm sung mih maru kowi dow maru naukhi-ah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 19:7" />Ngaraima mih maru kowi dow aia kowh tasin taken miuüa suiah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:7">aia kowh auiuauüa khowm aia kowi dow riaah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 19:7">Aia dow auiuauüa hown krawi taklang reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:7">Tawkche amatni dow aia kowi klangah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 19:8" />Chanlaima mih maru dow kowmatia kowi tasakrau reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:8">aiung angak tukra uowi mih maru dow ka iungra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 19:9" />Dai lai saksi thuak mih maru dow naka ripra ngengche kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:9">tek dai lai mih saksi dow napiak kown.<verse eid="PRO 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 19:10" />Abualama mih maru dow asowrma nauowi kown mih lahawm dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:10">mang chapauüa luk kowi nar nachang alow kown mih khowm mapaw lahawm dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 19:11" />Prengia uowi mih maru dow kunmarau naklak dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:11">chang ngak mih maru kowi bekah angak dowi mih maru dow ka ringkawra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 19:12" />Mang kowh kunmarau dow krangsi hek klow iawng kramra uowima chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:12">Tawkche aia kowh sanara dow bawrchak luk kowi nang kla khe kowh iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 19:13" />Abualama mih chauüa rakowi dow u-pa luk kowi piakra uang ting reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:13">taran dawma mih masi dow uang iat daplap mih iawng hing pusata hüah reng.<verse eid="PRO 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 19:14" />U-pa nowngia pe mih dow kim üa hai dawngthawnguan chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:14">Tawkche prengia uowima mih masi nowngia pe mih dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih.<verse eid="PRO 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 19:15" />Silikma mih maru dow müi dawma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:15">silik lup chang mih maru dow akhawr hown bowm reng.<verse eid="PRO 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 19:16" />Thurai rirow chün mih maru dow ka singra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:16">Tawkche aia kowh rirow prakowi pe ching dowi mih maru dow nakowng kown.<verse eid="PRO 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 19:17" />Ngaraima mih maru kowi khowng mih dow CHAKRAMANG kowi pe lowi mih iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:17">nami lup sung dow CHAKRAMANG aiamat ngengche napeah kown.<verse eid="PRO 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 19:18" />Khin uowi reng tak khe en chauüa kowi hawiah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:18">hawiah dowi mih dow nape piakah kownkow en khowngah mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 19:19" />Kunma ngakma mih maru kowi dow ripah ngengche diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:19">nadowi now aia nacham kla phih kown mih hownia plan plan alawng natakla kown chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 19:20" />Prengia lai hai pringhawi lai sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:20">nahanow en naka chanlaira kown.<verse eid="PRO 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 19:21" />Maru-uüa dow amatni nau changah kown mih lawnguan kowi ahuma sangkrang reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:21">Tawkche CHAKRAMANG naukrang iawng chowtaih nauang tachi kown.<verse eid="PRO 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 19:22" />Maru dow achur uowi dowi mih sakraura nau reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:22">dailama mih maru lak-e ngaraima mih maru lang iung.<verse eid="PRO 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 19:23" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih maru dow aia kowh chownglawng kowi sak-ih reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:23">naiawng mih maru luk kowi dow phih uang kla dowi kowi thaulangma uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 19:24" />Silikma mih maru dow hawm rowm kowi tangta rut hüah khowk chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:24">nawr kowi awr sawk hawm kown mih khowm nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 19:25" />Prawngren dawma mih maru kowi dow ripah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:25">nahanow abualama mih maru natawi tarip kown towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 19:25">Prengia uowi mih maru kowi pringah hawiah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:25">nahanow aia dow naka tukra kown.<verse eid="PRO 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 19:26" />A-pa kowi chang nowng mih hai a-u kowi prüt mih chauüa rakowi dow upa-uüa ka rukrai reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:26">now prawng renra kowi paw cham kla reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 19:27" />Chapa ow, ang kowh pringhawi laiklow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:27">nadowi now en tukah mih paw en natamata kown chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 19:28" />Angakma mih saksi dow tara nowm kowi changla rensi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:28">maru ngakuüa dow angak chang kowi lainowmma nau büah khai.<verse eid="PRO 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 19:29" />Prawngren dawma miuüa vüi dow kamrütta pe ripra hüah khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 19:29">bualama miuüa vüi paw towta pe müa kaneu khowk.<verse eid="PRO 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PRO 20" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 20:1" />Kham rak mih dow chanlai kowh nadowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:1">aia dow pua khowk hanow krawi towk ran reng.<verse eid="PRO 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 20:2" />Mang kowh kunmarau dow krangsi hek klow iawng kramra uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:2">aia kowi peah kunmarau mih maru dow nakowng kown.<verse eid="PRO 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 20:3" />Takhowk taranra hownia lang tahen mih maru dow ka ringkawra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:3">Tawkche bualama miuüa dow takhowk taran kowi anauma chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 20:4" />Silikma mih maru dow akhin khe luprak mih ienah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:4">Naiawng rakowi luprak ngen khin khe aia nau chepaw tawngpaw naka kown nadowi.<verse eid="PRO 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 20:5" />Maru kowh saktuak dow krawng dak tui iawng abüpma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:5">Tawkche prengia uowi mih maru dow maru kowh saktuak ka khüm reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 20:6" />Kaah sakowmma mih maru pahai kowmatia kowi takham mih uowi ahuma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:6">Tawkche krawi müah e dow kaah sakowm mih maru hing uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 20:7" />Achinawmma mih maru dow tiama nowm kowi mang reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:7">naiawng mih maru kowh chauüa dow prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 20:8" />Mang dow aia kowh chowm rah kowi chowm hanow chet tara reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:8">Nakhowk khe chang ngak mih maru kowi aia ka khüm reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 20:9" />“Ang kowh sak achinawmma ang changta khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:9">ang kowh ngak ang sia sauta khowk” pami mia chow naia tek kown?<verse eid="PRO 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 20:10" />CHAKRAMANG suiah mih maru uowi pre chaing;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:10">nami dow achima hawt khai uanh dowi mih maru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:10">now kuan kownkow adik chi dowi mih set tawng mih maru chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 20:11" />Ngeuüa kowi dow amatni kowh lup hownia chowtaih tuk matah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:11">Nakhowk khe chiang achinawmma bow, dowdow anowmma bow mih tukah reng.<verse eid="PRO 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 20:12" />CHAKRAMANG thawp a-i param mih dow süntak müa chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:12">now aia thawp a-i mik mih dow amük müa chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 20:13" />Müi kowi hang daw naknak diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:13">müi daw lai now en nangarai kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 20:13">Chang lup reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:13">nahanow en kowh chakkham ahuma nauowi kown.<verse eid="PRO 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 20:14" />Uanh ran mih dow aia nau ranah kown mih uanh sung pratah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:14">uanh sung natan pe kownkow “Nami iung dowi” pahai asum miia kowi aia tek pe reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 20:14">Tawkche aia dow ranla hanow mang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:14">now asung tanchow aia kala rakowi cham chang bawri reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 20:15" />Kuh hai asung khakma mih hua dow asung uowima chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:15">Tawkche tukra uowima mih nawr dow nami lak-e asung uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 20:16" />Prenlang maru paw lowi khe hang tawi takham diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:16">tawi takham khai hanow aia kowh tawnguat pawta pe diah.<verse eid="PRO 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 20:17" />Kuan rak hown kowh kaah mih chakkham dow asowr lang uowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:17">Tawkche achur khe dow nawr kowi se tabang kak khe kowh iawng naown kown.<verse eid="PRO 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 20:18" />Prengia iung hown sangkrangah diah</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:18">prengia iung tang mih ka dowi matchang hang cham tasen diah.<verse eid="PRO 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 20:19" />Lai chawk dawma mih maru dow itah kown mih laiklow paw phuangta reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:19">Naiawng rakowi pawpan dawma mih maru hown hang taiua diah.<verse eid="PRO 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 20:20" />U-pa kowi pe piati mih maru dow nakowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:20">aia dow iiu dawng kowi kowh maibu mit iawng naown kown.<verse eid="PRO 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 20:21" />Ning diachow hownia ahuma kram dawngthawnguan hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:21">achur kowi en vüi iung müa naown kown nadowi.<verse eid="PRO 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 20:22" />Maru chang en angak chepaw hangkow paw pe aklai diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:22">CHAKRAMANG luk kowi owmsak hanow aia nalawng en kown taih.<verse eid="PRO 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 20:23" />CHAKRAMANG dow achima khai uanh dowi mih maru kowi sui reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:23">aia dow adik chi dowi mih set tawng mih maru kowi sui reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 20:24" />A-i kowh chownglawng kowi lowra sia uang ting mih dow CHAKRAMANG pe phawah kowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:24">Naiawng rakowi akung kowi tawng chow naown kown mih lusa maru tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 20:25" />CHAKRAMANG tut-e nape uanap kown en nau hanow rik paw pe tuak kaneu diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:25">rik paw pe tuak kaneu dowi matchang hang takham diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 20:25">Tawngplawng kowchow panow akung kowi en takhamta iawng en nowng pe dowi chepaw naia kown.<verse eid="PRO 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 20:26" />Achanlaima mih mang dow maru ngak kowi ka khüm reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:26">aia dow mapaw sanaah dowi kowi maru ngak kowi naripah kown.<verse eid="PRO 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 20:27" />CHAKRAMANG kowh nowi dow lusa maru kowh lümla kowi pat krawi sawt reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:27">Naiawng rakowi aia dow lusa maru kowh saktuak tuk bowk chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 20:28" />Kaah sakowmma hai anowmma hown kruitown pren hanow mang dow aia kowh mangra naka reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:28">kaah sakowm iawng aia kruitown pren hanow aia kowh mang chowm rah dow anikma nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="PRO 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 20:29" />Klanguüa khe kowh kürra dow sakowmra uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:29">now lawngtanguüa kowh sam pau dow ringkawra uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 20:30" />Bawpah hanow maru ngak dow lup ngak hownia tarip reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 20:30">hupah hanow maru kowh sak dow takling taklai reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 20:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PRO 21" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 21:1" />Aw kowi kowh tui dow CHAKRAMANG kruiah mih iawng hawr reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:1">nami powm iawng mang kowh sak mih CHAKRAMANG kruiah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 21:2" />Maru-uüa dow amatni changah mih lup maten anowmma padow tatuak reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:2">Tawkche CHAKRAMANG dow amatni kowh sak nowk pe khai pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 21:3" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowi tawncher hown phuchuaah mih lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:3">aiungma hai anowmma chang lup mih kowi lang awmrawm chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 21:4" />Maru ngakuüa dow chang bawri hai chang owrow reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:4">amatni changah mih lup dow angak kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 21:5" />Rik tuakah kaneu kowh aklumma chang lup mih maru dow ahuma ka dawngthawnguan reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:5">Tawkche rik tuakah dowi matchang sakkrowng sakkrangma chang lup mih maru dow ngarai reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 21:6" />Kuan rak hown kowh kaah mih dawngthawnguan dow khowt pat natak kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:6">naiawng chang angak rakowi aia dow nakowng kown.<verse eid="PRO 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 21:7" />Maru ngakuüa dow krawi chang nowng powng rakowi napiak kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow anowmma mih lup chang kown nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 21:8" />Chang lup ngak mih maru dow tiama kuikekma mih kowi mang reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:8">Tawkche achinawmma mih maru dow tiama nowm kowi mang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 21:9" />Taran dawma mih masi hown kim kowi taiua uowi mih lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:9">kowmatia malowkchow kimluk kowi uowi mih lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 21:10" />Maru ngak dow lup ngak chang kowi anauma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:10">aia dow aia kowh kimping namkhetuüa kowi saksing sanaah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 21:11" />Prawngren dawma mih maru kowi ripah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:11">nahanow abualama mih maru paw natawi tarip kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 21:11">Prengia uowi mih maru kowi pringah hawiah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:11">nahanow aia dow naka tukra iung kown.<verse eid="PRO 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 21:12" />Anowmma mih Thurai dow maru ngakuüa changah mih lup tuk reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:12">aia dow naiawngün maru ngakuüa kowi piakah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 21:13" />Ngaraima miuüa kar se lü khowng mih khin khe sünta pe dowi hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:13">kar se aia lü khowng mih khin khe paw maru nasünta pe kown nadowi.<verse eid="PRO 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 21:14" />Kunmarau en mih maru kowi kukpa peah awmrawm sung diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:14">nahanow aia kowh kunmaraura naprowng kown towbowt.<verse eid="PRO 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 21:15" />Achinawmma mih maru-uüa dow tara nowm kowi awmrawm reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:15">Tawkche tara nowm dow maru ngakuüa vüi piakra chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 21:16" />Prengia tiama hownia kowh lang powt mih dow abualama kowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:16">aia dow kowng miuüa uowi rah kowi natawi uowi kown.<verse eid="PRO 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 21:17" />Piawra prakowi lowpa mih maru dow nangarai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:17">kham rak mih hai asung khakma mih chakkham lowpa miuüa paw nakureng kown nadowi.<verse eid="PRO 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 21:18" />Maru ngakuüa dow achinawmma mih maru kowi towkah akrat reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:18">Tawkche achur kowi dow amatni chowtaih nakawm nakrat kown.<verse eid="PRO 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 21:19" />Taran dawma mih hai kunma ngakma mih masi hown taiua uowi mih lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:19">süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowmatia malowkchow uowi mih lang iung.<verse eid="PRO 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 21:20" />Prengia uowima mih maru kim kowi dow asung khakma mih uanh uowi reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:20">Tawkche abualama mih maru dow amatni kaah mih srui cham sunta reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 21:21" />Anowmma hai kaah sakowmma mih tiama kowi süngürma hown mang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:21">naiawng mang mih maru dow singra, prasira hai ringkawra naka kown.<verse eid="PRO 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 21:22" />Chanlaima mih maru dow akürma miuüa kowh marow krawi sen reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:22">amatni sakowmah mih akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim dow aia krawi piakta pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 21:23" />Kowmatia nawr hai dai mih khetah kaneu diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:23">nahanow phih hownia en naia talawng kown.<verse eid="PRO 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 21:24" />Prawngren dawma mih maru dow bawrima hai owrowma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:24">naiawng mih maru dow abawrima hown chang lup reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 21:25" />Silikma mih maru dow chang lup kown nau dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:25">aia dow silik rakowi akhawr hown nakowng kown.<verse eid="PRO 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 21:26" />Tawngbak mih maru dow ka kown mih saktuak kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:26">Tawkche achinawmma mih maru dow akawklawma hown pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 21:27" />Maru ngakuüa kowh phuchua dow CHAKRAMANG sui reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:27">angakma mih tuak hown amatni phuchuaah mih khowm aia lang sui ngamlam chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 21:28" />Thuak dai lai saksi mih maru dow napiak kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:28">Tawkche tek lainowm mih maru kowh laiklow dow maru nasünta pe kown.<verse eid="PRO 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 21:29" />Maru ngak dow sangprowk laitek kowi mapaw rukrai dowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:29">Tawkche maru iung dow chang lup dowi rawn rik tuakah kaneu reng.<verse eid="PRO 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 21:30" />Maru kowh chanlaira hai prengia hown dow CHAKRAMANG kowi nowng kingküaah dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:30">now lusa maru kowh kamrütra hown paw CHAKRAMANG kowi nowng kingküaah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 21:31" />Kawrnga dow tasen khe kowh vüi kamrütiama towta reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 21:31">Tawkche awngra dow CHAKRAMANG hownia chowtaih.<verse eid="PRO 21:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PRO 22" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 22:1" />Ahuma dawngthawnguan uowi mih lak-e ming iung nang iung uowi mih lang iung,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:1">kuh hai tai lak-e maru hownia ka ringkawra mih lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 22:2" />Maru maten dow CHAKRAMANG thawpah mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:2">kurengma mih hai ngaraima mih paw aia thawpah mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 22:3" />Prengia uowima mih maru dow kla phih kown mih tuk hanow lang tahen reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:3">Tawkche abualama mih maru dow kla phih kown mih tuk chepaw thüa reng rakowi kawm reng.<verse eid="PRO 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 22:4" />Khamsum khamdawma mih maru dow kurengra, ringkawra hai chowngdawng sakklangra ka reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:4">Thurai kowi ringkawma hown kram mih maru dow kurengra, ringkawra hai chowngdawng sakklangra ka reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 22:5" />Maru ngakuüa mangah mih tiama kowi dow phih hai akrat pusa kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:5">Tawkche kowmatia kowi takhet kaneu mih maru dow naiawng mih hownia lang tahen reng.<verse eid="PRO 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 22:6" />Tiama nowm kowi namang kown mih chauüa kowi tüngsangah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:6">nahanow amatni lawngtang mowr pat naiawng nachang büah kown.<verse eid="PRO 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 22:7" />Kurengma mih maru dow ngaraima mih maru luk kowi chang alow reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:7">pe lowi mih maru dow paw lowi mih maru luk kowi chang alow reng.<verse eid="PRO 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 22:8" />Angak liu sawt mih maru-uüa dow achur kowi angak uih nangen kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:8">nahanow kunmarau rakowi aia krawi chang nowng mih dow nataing kown towbowt.<verse eid="PRO 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 22:9" />Kawklawma mih maru dow aia kowh chakkham ngarai miuüa kowi retla pe reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:9">Naiawng rakowi aia dow ka prasi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 22:10" />Prawngren dawma mih maru kowi prütta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:10">nahanow taüara, taranra hai tanangra nauowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PRO 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 22:11" />Saktuak chinawmma mih hai saksing sanara laiklow tek khai hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:11">naiawng mih maru hown dow mangkri chang auiua reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 22:12" />Tukra uowima mih maru kowi dow CHAKRAMANG khowngah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:12">Tawkche kaah sakowm dowi mih maru kowh sangkrangra dow aia pe tachiah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 22:13" />Silikma mih maru dow kim kowi uowi phulu chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:13">aia dow, “Prang kowi cham lawt now krangsi mak,” padow tek reng.<verse eid="PRO 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 22:14" />Chang iang mih masiuüa kowh laiklow dow abüpma mih kuam iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:14">CHAKRAMANG kunmarauah mih maru dow nami kuam kowi nadowh kown.<verse eid="PRO 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 22:15" />Ngeuüa dow bualama mih lup chang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:15">Tawkche pringah hawiah hanow naiawng mih lup nataingta kown.<verse eid="PRO 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 22:16" />Kureng kown nau rakowi ngarai miuüa kowi chang nowng mih maru dow nangarai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:16">kurengma mih maru kowi pe awmrawm sung mih maru paw nangarai kown.<verse eid="PRO 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chanlaima mih maru-uüa kowh prengia lai</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 22:17" />Chanlaima miuüa kowh laiklow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:17">ang tüngsang en mih kowi kaneuma pe ching diah.<verse eid="PRO 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 22:18" />Naiawngün laiklow en tuakah reng hanow en napiaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:18">naiawngün laiklow dow phuangah reng diah.<verse eid="PRO 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 22:19" />Naiawngün dow ani ang pe tuk pe ta en khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:19">Nami dow CHAKRAMANG kowi en pacham neplawng nesak lah pakowh chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 22:20" />En vüi ang ruita chanlai laiklow süngkawm chap khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:20">naiawngün dow tukra hai chanlai lawng atekma chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 22:21" />Naiawngün hownia dow anowmma mih hai achingma mih lawnguan en natuk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:21">nahanow uang chin en miuüa kowi aiungma en nanowng tek pe kown towbowt.<verse eid="PRO 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">1 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 22:22" />Ngaraima mih maru-uüa kowi kür hown hangkow paw pe uanh diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:22">ngaraima mih maru-uüa kowi dow tara chet kowi hangkow changah nowng diah.<verse eid="PRO 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 22:23" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG natangila kown chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:23">amatni kowi rup pe uanh mih maru kowi dow CHAKRAMANG nakowngta kown.<verse eid="PRO 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">2 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 22:24" />Kunma ngakma mih maru hown hang ta-auiua diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:24">kunmarau naklak mih maru hown hang taiua diah.<verse eid="PRO 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 22:25" />Aia hown en taiua hanow aia iawng en natawi phaw kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:25">nahanow nami hownia en natawi piak kown towbowt.<verse eid="PRO 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">3 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 22:26" />Maru paw lowi mih kowi hang tawi takham diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:26">aia nowng pe dowi now en nape kown mih hang tawi takham diah.<verse eid="PRO 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 22:27" />En tawi takhamta mih che en nowng pe dowi hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:27">en kowh uowi mih maten klen kowi en kowh mawk rah khowm napawta en kown.<verse eid="PRO 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">4 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 22:28" />En kowh pipu-uüa dow sünghi mat müa chowkla hua ai khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:28">naiawngün mat müa dow hangkow krawi sütsowita diah.<verse eid="PRO 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">5 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 22:29" />Akiakma tuk chang lup mih maru kowi dow manguüa pe changah lup reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 22:29">naiawng mih maru dow iawngpa mih maru nimkrüa kowi nachang lup kown nadowi.<verse eid="PRO 22:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PRO 23" />
  <para style="s">6 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 23:1" />Kruitown mih hown en taiua cha chakkham khai hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:1">en pur kowi tawng chow uowi mih müah kaneu diah.<verse eid="PRO 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 23:2" />En che chak kürma hanow kaneu diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:2">chakkham chak eta nown diah.<verse eid="PRO 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 23:3" />Aia kowh chak iung kham iung hangkow ir diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:3">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow nakuan en kownkow pe cha en mih chepaw naia kown.<verse eid="PRO 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">7 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 23:4" />Kurengra prakowi khowt pat hang towk iow diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:4">naiawng chang kown mih saktuak taingta diah.<verse eid="PRO 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 23:5" />Tangka pawisa dow akhowk lenma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:5">naiawngün dow uamu iawng alap awm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:5">now uamu iawng kuang kowi iow reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">8 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 23:6" />Sipma mih maru kowh chakkham hangkow tawi cha diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:6">aia kowh chak iung kham iung hangkow tawi ir diah.<verse eid="PRO 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 23:7" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow aia kowh chakkham sung tuak reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:7">aia dow “Du pat cha ba,” padow tek en reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:7">Tawkche aia kowh saktuak dow aia laiklow iawng nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 23:8" />En chata mih khowm nahükta kown mih en nanau kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:8">now aia kowi kowh en kiowta mih dow naiawm kown.<verse eid="PRO 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">9 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 23:9" />Bualama mih maru hown hangkow talawp diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:9">en kowh prengia lai dow aia nasui en kown chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">10 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 23:10" />Achük alai khe kowh rihi mat müa hua ai hangkow sütsowi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:10">now saratchowuüa kowh krawng bawn paw hangkow krawi khünta pe diah.<verse eid="PRO 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 23:11" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh lawng miia dow akürma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:11">aia dow amatni kowi tawi tangila hanow natawi kingküa en kown.<verse eid="PRO 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">11 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 23:12" />Tatüng tasang prakowi towsak diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:12">now tukra laiklow kowi pe param diah.<verse eid="PRO 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">12 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 23:13" />Chauüa kowi pringah hawiah reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:13">müa hown ripah chepaw aia dow kowng dowi tham.<verse eid="PRO 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 23:14" />Aia kowi dow müa hown naripah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:14">nahanow aia dow kowngra hownia naia plai kown.<verse eid="PRO 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">13 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 23:15" />Chapa ow, en che chanlai khai hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:15">lainowmma ang naawmrawm kown.<verse eid="PRO 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 23:16" />En che tek lainowm khai hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:16">lainowmma ang napiaw kown.<verse eid="PRO 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">14 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 23:17" />Maru ngakuüa kowi hangkow irsi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:17">nami lak-e CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kramah diah.<verse eid="PRO 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 23:18" />Naiawng che en chang hanow pur prakowi en naiung kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:18">now en kowh sakowmra mih nauang tachi kown.<verse eid="PRO 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">15 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 23:19" />Chapa ow, ang laiklow sünta hanow chanlai diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:19">now tiama nowm kowi namang kown mih kowi pe ching diah.<verse eid="PRO 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 23:20" />Apuama miuüa hown hang tawi taiua diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:20">chak kürma miuüa hown paw hang tawi taiua diah.<verse eid="PRO 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 23:21" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow arak kham kürma miuüa hai chak kürma miuüa dow ngarai reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:21">cha müi cha müi chang miuüa dow ngarai rakowi atheknama mih tawnguat khup reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">16 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 23:22" />Pe en chownglawng mih en pa laiklow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:22">en u lawngtang khowk hanow mingkhetah diah.<verse eid="PRO 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 23:23" />Anowm, chanlaira, tüngsangra hai aiung angak tukra nakala kownkow towk iow reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:23">naiawngün dow en kata khowk hanow hangkow iawmah diah.<verse eid="PRO 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 23:24" />Achinawmma mih chauüa rakowi dow u-pa awmrawm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:24">chanlaima mih chauüa rakowi dow u-pa piaw reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 23:25" />En u en pa awmrawmla iawng chang lup diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:25">pen en mih en u piawla iawng chang lup reng diah.<verse eid="PRO 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">17 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 23:26" />Chapa ow, ang tüng ang sang en mih kowi pe ching diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:26">ang changah mih lup hownia mü ku diah.<verse eid="PRO 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 23:27" />Chawkkrawma dow kuam büpma mih iawng kramra uowima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:27">chang iang mih masiuüa dow abüpma mih tuikuam iawng kramra uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 23:28" />Naiawng mih masiuüa dow damra iawng hawt pawm hüah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:28">amatni rakowi dow kaah sakowm dowi mih maru iun uang lang kawm ngamlam chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">18 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 23:29" />Mia iawng mih chow kawm reng?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:29">Mia iawng mih chow kar hai nguk reng?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 23:29">Mia iawng mih chow taran reng?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:29">Mia iawng mih chow klawk uailai reng?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 23:29">Mia iawng mih chow ka ngarau reng?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:29">Mia iawng mih chow mik rikma phaw reng?<verse eid="PRO 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 23:30" />Naiawng phaw mih dow ahuma kham rak miuüa kowh chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:30">amatni dow nakham ngamlam kownkow asar asar krawi paw arak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 23:31" />Arak tui dow apowm klangiungma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:31">Nami dow bia kowi klinah khe chimprowngchow chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:31">now iu khamah khe paw asowrchow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 23:31">Tawkche en mih hangkow tawi ir diah.<verse eid="PRO 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 23:32" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow achur kowi nami dow rua iawng chawt reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:32">akruma mih rua iawng nami dow chawt reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 23:33" />Nakhowk khe en dow nacham khi naklak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:33">now nacham tuak naklak hanow en tek naklak kown.<verse eid="PRO 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 23:34" />Sata kowi kowh chawnlawng kowi talek lawlaw mih maru iawng en naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:34">talek liplip lawplawp se chawnlawng mang khe kowh maru iawng en naown kown.<verse eid="PRO 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 23:35" />“Kowbüah bawp ang tawkche ang ka arau dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:35">kowbüah tep ang tawkche ang tuk dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 23:35">Tawng khe chow ang naawr thowr kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 23:35">ang thowr now ang ka kham rak iawk kown bow?” padow en natek kown.<verse eid="PRO 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PRO 24" />
  <para style="s">19 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 24:1" />Maru ngakuüa kowi hangkow irsi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:1">amatni hown taiua uowi kown mih paw hangkow nau büa diah.<verse eid="PRO 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 24:2" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh saktuak dow nakrawi chang nowng kown mih kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:2">amatni talawp mih dow nakrawi chang ngak kown mih lawnguan kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">20 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 24:3" />Chanlaira hown dow maru thawp kim reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:3">prengia hown dow kim mih akhawtma changah reng.<verse eid="PRO 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 24:4" />Tukra hown dow asung khakma mih hai klangiungma mih uanh nowng kram reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:4">now naiawngün uanh dow akhawtma mih kim tek pat towah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">21 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 24:5" />Chanlaima mih maru kowh dow ia changra huma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:5">tukra uowima mih maru kowh dow kür hu ngamlam chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 24:6" />Cham dowk tasen kown now cham rik paw prengia diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:6">prengia pek mih akawmma uowi hanow tasen awng reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">22 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 24:7" />Abualama mih maru dow chanlaira laiklow tukta dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:7">aia dow marow tapplawt kowi kowh takua talawmra kowi tawngpaw tawi tek dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">23 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 24:8" />Chang angak kownkow sangkrang reng mih maru kowi dow maru ngak pahai maru tuakah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:8">now aia kowi kingküa dawma mih maru pahai maru tukah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 24:9" />Abualama mih maru kowh sangkrangra dow angak chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:9">prawngren dawma mih kowi dow maru suiah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">24 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 24:10" />Kla phih mih khin khe hangkow sak nen diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:10">en sak nen mih dow en kowh kür uowi dowi mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">25 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 24:11" />Chet pe tara nowm dowi kowi kowngta kown mih maru kowi lawngah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:11">naiawng mih maru kowi nakrawi lawng kown mih hangkow awi-ai diah.<verse eid="PRO 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 24:12" />“Tawngpaw ang tawi tuk dowi,” pahai hang tada diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:12">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai dow en kowh saktuak tuk reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 24:12">Aia dow en tuakah mih maten tuk reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:12">aia dow maru maten changah mih lup iawng nape aklai kown.<verse eid="PRO 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">26 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 24:13" />Chapa ow, cha kuai tui diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:13">Nami dow en vüi iung müa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 24:13">Aba hownia cha kuai tui diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:13">Nami dow en nawr kowi nading kown.<verse eid="PRO 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 24:14" />Nami iawng chanlaira paw en sak vüi iung müa chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:14">en kowh chanlaira uowi now en chownglawng kowi sakowmra uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:14">now en kowh sakowmra dow natapiak kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PRO 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">27 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 24:15" />Achinawmma mih maru kowh kim hangkow krawi powng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:15">naiawng mih maru kowh kim hangkow krawi piak diah.<verse eid="PRO 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 24:16" />Achinawmma mih maru dow tim ranit kat chepaw awr plan rü reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:16">Tawkche maru ngak dow piakra uang ting akat now hing piak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">28 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 24:17" />En kowh ransu tim khe hang awmrawm diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:17">aia tatheu mih khin khe hang piaw diah.<verse eid="PRO 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 24:18" />Naiawng en chang mih CHAKRAMANG khita hanow aia dow nasak-ih en kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:18">now en kowh ransu kowi dow aia naripah kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PRO 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">29 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 24:19" />Maru ngakuüa lawnguan tata hanow hang tuak krat diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:19">maru ngakuüa kowi khita hanow hang irsi diah.<verse eid="PRO 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 24:20" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh dow tawngpaw sakowmra uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:20">now maru ngakuüa dow mit kown chowbowt mih maibu iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">30 Kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 24:21" />Chapa ow, CHAKRAMANG hai mang kowi kram hai ringkawah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:21">CHAKRAMANG hai mang kowi kingküa dawma miuüa hown hang tawi tahum diah.<verse eid="PRO 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 24:22" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow linlanma napiak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:22">CHAKRAMANG hai mang hownia ripra uang ting kown mih dow miapaw tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akeng mih prengia lai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 24:23" />Maiawngün paw chanlaima miuüa kowh laiklow chekhai:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 24:23">Tara chetra kowi mia kowi paw tangila kown iung dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 24:24" />Chang ngak mih maru kowi tek pe maru iung mih tara chet miia kowi dow pren towng nam towng kowi kowh maru-uüa mih nakhareah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:24">now aia kowi dow chen towng chap towng kowi kowh maru-uüa mih napeah piati kown.<verse eid="PRO 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 24:25" />Tawkche chang ngak mih maru kowi maru ngak pahai phuang mih tara chet miia dow aiungma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:25">aia dow aia chownglawng kowi naiungla kown mih prasi naka kown.<verse eid="PRO 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 24:26" />Auiua che tek lainowm khai hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:26">nami dow auiua ching pami tatukra chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 24:27" />Prang kowi kowh lup rik churta bowk diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:27">üa hai laih ün rik kamrütta kaneu diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 24:27">Nami kung kowi phai chang kim iang.<verse eid="PRO 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 24:28" />Tawngpaw tawi tuk dowi matchang en kimping namkhetuüa kowi kingküala mih saksi hang tawi thuak diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:28">now amatni lawnguan kowi hang tek dai lai diah.<verse eid="PRO 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 24:29" />“Aia chang ang iawng ang paw nachangah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:29">aia chang mih iawng ang nasat pe aklai kown,” padow hang tek diah.<verse eid="PRO 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 24:30" />Silikma mih maru kowh laih ria iawng ang cham kowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:30">abualama mih maru kowh grep krum iawng ang cham mang khai.<verse eid="PRO 24:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 24:31" />Nakowi dow chuh mung hing tamum klum khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:31">mawh awr ru kowh krawng kowi hing tasak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:31">hua hown kowh tap paw tim khai.<verse eid="PRO 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 24:32" />Naiawngün ang khita hanow ang pawtuak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:32">nami hownia ang ka tatukra mih maiawng:<verse eid="PRO 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33-34" style="v" sid="PRO 24:33-34" />Müi nawngchow tak, müi rau reng tak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:33-34">mawk se em rut nawngchow tak pahai uowi miuüa tut-e dow alenma akhawr nauang ting kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 24:33-34">now damra thowkta kung kowi ta ngarai mih iawng naphaw kown.<verse eid="PRO 24:33-34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PRO 25" />
  <para style="s">Sawlawmawn kowh akeng mih prengia lai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 25:1" />Maiawngün paw Sawlawmawn kowh chanlai lawng chekhai. Maiawngün dow Juda pren mang Hezekia kowh maru iukuüa krawi pawah now plan ruiah mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 25:2" />Thurai ka ringkawra mih dow lowra sia itah rakowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:2">mang ka ringkawra mih dow naiawngün sia krawi phuang rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 25:3" />Mukuang lowng mih hai lusa büp mih krang dow miapaw nowng nowk nowng khai dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:3">nami iawng dow manguüa kowh saktuak paw miapaw ia tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 25:4" />Tai kowi kowh akih lang kuakta pe diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:4">nahanow uanh thawp sara mih nami tai hown uanh klangiungma mih naia thawp kown.<verse eid="PRO 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 25:5" />Maru ngak kowi dow mang pur hownia prütta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:5">nahanow lup iung changra hownia aia kowh mang chowm rah dow anikma nauowi kown towbowt.<verse eid="PRO 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 25:6" />Mang pur kowi kowmatia kowi hang tanü maru iuk diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:6">maru iukuüa pungmadawng kowi paw hang tawi chowm diah.<verse eid="PRO 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 25:7" />“En chowm rah nadowi,” pahai maru iukuüa pur kowi ka rukrai mih lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:7">“Mami re-e phai uang chowm,” pahai haw en mih lang iung.<verse eid="PRO 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 25:8" />En khi-ah mih lawnguan kowi nachet tara kownkow tara chetra kowi alenma hangkow kowi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:8">akeng mih maru thuak en saksi rakowi en sum khai e dow tawng chow en nachangah kown?<verse eid="PRO 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 25:9" />Kimping namkhet hown en taran khai hanow enni matia taiungah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:9">now a-it takla mih laiklow dow hang cham phuangah diah.<verse eid="PRO 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 25:10" />A-it takla mih laiklow maru ta hanow maru naprawng naren en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:10">now en kowh ming ngak nang ngak dow katpaw naprowng kown nadowi.<verse eid="PRO 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 25:11" />Lakke takla khe kowh prengia lai dow asung uowima.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:11">Nami dow tai bia kowi tow kuh klu mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 25:12" />Kuh ramseng hai kuh uanh lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:12">chanlaima mih maru kowh prengia lai sünta mih lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 25:13" />Kaah sakowmma mih satang phowng mih dow luprak ngen khin khe kowh nang kla mih iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:13">Aia dow aia kowi kowh chinah miia kowi pe sak-ihah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 25:14" />Pe kown takham kowh pe dowi mih maru dow uang iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:14">aia dow uangnim hai li uowi chepaw uang uang dowi mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 25:15" />Town sak mih maru dow mang kowh saktuak nowng klowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:15">laiklow klamra hownia dow nau sünta laiklow dowi mih maru kowh saktuak paw nowng klowi reng.<verse eid="PRO 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 25:16" />Ka kuai tui hanow lakke mowrchow chaah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:16">cha hu lai now en nahük kown.<verse eid="PRO 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 25:17" />En kowh kimping namkhet kim kowi hang cham pua naknak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:17">en cham pua lai now aia nasilik khi en kown chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 25:18" />Kimping namkhet luk kowi thuak dai lai saksi mih maru dow maru piak müa chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:18">naiawng mih maru dow müa dung, saidawng hai achukma mih salangba sek iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 25:19" />Kla phih mih khin khe kaah sakowm dowi mih maru luk kowi neplawng nesak mih maru dow maiawng chekhai:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:19">nami dow iüng talowk mih hown cha chakkham mih iawng hai klowng baima mih hown mang mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 25:20" />Saktuak pusa mih maru kowi hangkow tek pe piaw meng diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:20">kowtek pe mih dow chungrau khe kowh klüp kowrmow mih hai ma sing kowi the sur tui mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 25:21" />En kowh ransu che sakkrai khai hanow pe chaah chakkham diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:21">aia che tui sakkrai khai hanow pe khamah tui diah.<verse eid="PRO 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 25:22" />Naiawng en chang now aia mih narukrai hanow kunmarau naprowng kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:22">now CHAKRAMANG dow nape en awmrawm sung kown.<verse eid="PRO 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 25:23" />Tawngphak hownia kowh uang mih li dow uang pawla uang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:23">nami iawng dow prawngren dawma mih maru kowh laiklow rakowi maru kunmarau reng.<verse eid="PRO 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 25:24" />Taran dawma mih masi hown taiua uowi mih lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:24">kimluk kowi kowmatia malowkchow cham lang uowi mih lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 25:25" />Tui sakkrai mih maru kowi dow peah tui rua hanow kow sowr reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:25">nami iawng dow alakma hownia kowh satang iung ta hanow sak sowr reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 25:26" />Maru ngak rakowi achinawmma mih maru tawi chang ngak mih dow tui pua iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:26">aia dow achimchow mih tuikuam kowi kowh asürlawkma mih tui iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 25:27" />Ahuma kham kuai tui mih iung dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:27">nami iawng nakala ringkawra kownkow chang lup mih paw iung dowi.<verse eid="PRO 25:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 25:28" />Nowng town sak dowi mih maru dow marow iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 25:28">aia dow tap apiaknama mih marow iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 25:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PRO 26" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 26:1" />Satma khin khe nang kla mih hai luprak ngen khin uang uang mih taklak dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:1">nami iawng bualama mih maru kowi naringkawah kown mih paw auan uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 26:2" />Aiawnglowma maru pe en piati mih dow en luk kowi nauang kla kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:2">Nami dow kimpuk ua hai kirchow cham iow panglang mih iawng naown kown.<verse eid="PRO 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 26:3" />Kawrnga kowi dow müa hown bawpah kown takla reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:3">kawrngaramchük kowi dow kruk pe nawrbawng kown takla reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 26:3">Nami iawng bualama mih maru kowi dow müa hown kumlawng kowi ahup takla reng.<verse eid="PRO 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 26:4" />Bualama mih maru kowh asung uowi dowi mih laiklow kowi hangkow klangah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:4">en che klangah hanow en paw aia iawng natawi phaw kown chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 26:5" />Bualama mih maru kowh laiklow kowi aklang takla khai hanow aia iawng klangah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:5">naiawng nadowi hanow aia dow chanlaima pahai natanü kown chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 26:6" />Abualama mih maru kowi cham chinah satang phowng mih maru dow cham paw phih mih iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:6">aia dow kowmatia klowng dungta mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 26:7" />Abualama mih maru kowh chanlaira laiklow dow asung uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:7">Nami dow klowng baima mih maru kowh asung uowi dowi mih klowng iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 26:8" />Bualama mih maru kowi tüng pe ringkawra mih maru dow ap iaiba mih maru iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:8">aia dow iaiba kim kowi tap pe iaiuih now ap iaiba reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 26:9" />Abualama mih maru kowh chanlaira laiklow dow apuama mih maru iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:9">aia dow rak pua lai bowt kowh rut kowi cham ka sat khai.<verse eid="PRO 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 26:10" />Abualama mih kowi hai apuama mih maru kowi pe changah lup mih maru dow kramra uowima chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:10">aia dow tawngah kaneu dowi matchang ap leba naklak kowh maru kowi pe arau mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 26:11" />Kui dow aia hükta mih kowi plan chaah kownkow plan kowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:11">nami iawng bualama mih maru paw bualama mih lup plan chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 26:12" />Tanü chanlai mih maru kowi dow tüngsang kratma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:12">nami lak-e bualama mih maru kowi tüngsang lang iah chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 26:13" />Silikma mih maru dow maiawng tek reng, “Tiama kowi krangsi uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:13">kramra uowima mih krangsi tiama kowi len iawklawk mih uowi lowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 26:14" />Kimplawt kowi kowh akli kowi dow kimbüng tachawp hüah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:14">nami iawng silikma mih maru dow phangbek kowi hing mawk hüa chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 26:15" />Silikma mih maru dow hawm rowm kowi tangta rut hüah khowk chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:15">nawr kowi awr sawk hawm kown mih khowm silik chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 26:16" />Tuakah kaneu kowh klang maru mih chanlaima mih maru ranit ia lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:16">aiamat lang chanlai pahai silikma mih maru dow tatuak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 26:17" />Tiama kowi maru taran khe cham tawi klang mih maru dow kramra uowima chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:17">aia dow cham mang panglang mih kui kowi town pe paramkui mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="PRO 26:18-19" />Kuan maru kung kowi, “Ang ngawkah mih taih,” pahai tek mih maru dow kramra uowima chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:18-19">aia dow lün pluplup mih leba sek ap naklak mih athuklama mih maru iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:18-19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 26:20" />Maih kowi bawk pe sawp dowi hanow maih mit reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:20">nami iawng lai dawma mih maru uowi dowi now taran prowng reng.<verse eid="PRO 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 26:21" />Maru taran khe tawi towk ran mih maru dow mairing kowi tow pe maivia mih iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:21">naiawng mih maru dow maih lün kowi bawk pe sawp mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 26:22" />Taprawng taren mih laiklow dow asowrma mih chakkham iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:22">naiawng mih laiklow dow maru sak lak kowi kup ruirui reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 26:23" />Saktuak ngakma mih maru kowh sakraura laiklow dow uanh kowi sow pe tai mih iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:23">aia kowh laiklow dow bawn kawng kowi kowh sow pe tai mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 26:24" />Sui maru mih dow aia kowh sangkrangra ngak mih lai iung hown petah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:24">Tawkche aia kowh sak kowi dow limmara kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 26:25" />Naiawng mih maru kowh laiklow dow adingma chepaw hangkow owm diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:25">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia sak kowi dow suiiai kaniaima mih chap uowi huma chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 26:26" />Aia kowh sangkrangra ngak dow lai iung hown aia petah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:26">Tawkche aia kowh nami sangkrangra dow bowkbowk pur kowi natatung kown.<verse eid="PRO 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 26:27" />Maru vüi kowi krawi chak leng mih maru dow aiamat tasowk reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:27">maru luk kowi lün huaklu mih maru dow nami huaklu hown aia tanüm reng.<verse eid="PRO 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 26:28" />Dailama mih maru-uüa dow maru kowi sui reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 26:28">dai lai hown dow piakra uang ting reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 26:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PRO 27" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 27:1" />Tharau kowh lawnguan kowi hang chang bawri diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow tawng khe chow tawng chow own kown mih en tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 27:2" />Akeng mih maru pacham kiow en lah taih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:2">en mih kowmatia kowi hang takiow diah.<verse eid="PRO 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 27:3" />Hua dow adikma, now se paw adikma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:3">Tawkche bualama mih maru towkah mih kunmarau dow naiawngün lak-e lang dih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 27:4" />Kunmaraura hai sak-ih dowi mih ra dow angakma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:4">Tawkche khowrbown dow nami lak-e paw lang nga chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 27:5" />Kukpa sakrau en mih maru lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:5">tüng en atawi mih maru lang iung.<verse eid="PRO 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 27:6" />Auiua pe arau mih dow en iung müa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:6">Tawkche ransu nam en awm mih dow nachang en angak kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 27:7" />Mu duma mih maru dow kuai tui khowm kham kown nau dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:7">Tawkche sakkraima mih maru tut-e dow akhakma mih chap paw adingma chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 27:8" />Towla kim hüah now cham mang panglang mih maru dow uakling iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:8">aia dow towla bai hüah kowh cham iow panglang mih uakling iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 27:9" />Paingbawng hai nam iungma mih maikhük nam hown dow kow sowr reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:9">nami iawng auiua kowh prengia pek dow aiungma chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 27:10" />En auiua hai en pa kowh auiua kowi hangkow nuata diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:10">kla phih mih khin khe alakma kowi uowi mih en tasin taken miuüa tut-e hangkow lü khowng diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 27:10">Atawnchow mih kimping namkhet dow alakma kowi kowh tainau lak-e lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 27:11" />Chapa ow, chanlai diah, pe ang awmrawmra diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:11">nahanow en rakowi khare ang miuüa kowi ang naia klangah kown towbowt.<verse eid="PRO 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 27:12" />Prengiama mih maru dow phih uang kla kown mih satang tuk hanow lang tahen reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:12">Tawkche abualama mih maru dow kla phih kown mih tuk chepaw thüa reng rakowi kawm reng.<verse eid="PRO 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 27:13" />Prenlang maru paw lowi khe hang tawi takham diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:13">tawi takham khai hanow aia kowh tawnguat pawta pe diah.<verse eid="PRO 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 27:14" />Amia iawng mih chow mur rü hanow kimping namkhetuüa kowi atünma krawi pe prasi khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:14">Nami dow prasi nadowi kowi piati iawng maru nadowkah kown.<verse eid="PRO 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 27:15" />Taran dawma mih masi dow siadawng khe uangchak tahow dowi mih iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:15">aia dow aia kowh nawr kowi pe tanaiah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 27:16" />Li hai sau kowi dow rut hown ia dowkah dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:16">nami iawng taran dawma mih masi kowi dow ririmma ia towah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 27:17" />Lawngha kowi achukma changah kown nau now lawngha lala asük takla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:17">nami iawng lusa maru mih lowkkowlowk natatüng tasang kown takla.<verse eid="PRO 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 27:18" />Khet uidut singh mih maru dow ka cha uidut uih reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:18">kim iah kowi chang pe lup mih maru dow ka ringkawra reng.<verse eid="PRO 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 27:19" />Tui kowi tatamü hanow kowmatia powm takhi reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:19">nami iawng maru kowh uowi krang khi hanow kowmatia kowh uowi krang paw tuk reng.<verse eid="PRO 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 27:20" />Makownguüa uowi rah hai maisingkan dow katpaw du dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:20">nami iawng maru kowh nau rah sia dow katpaw adu uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 27:21" />Kuh hai tai kowi dow achangma chünchü mih natukla kownkow maih hown chaingah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:21">Tawkche maru kowi dow ka kiowrira mih hown chaingah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 27:22" />Abualama mih maru kowi cha thua iawng thuaah chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:22">aia kowh bualara mih aia hownia napowt kown nadowi.<verse eid="PRO 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 27:23" />En kowh rua hai ruapur hawmh kowi khetah kaneu diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:23">en kowh tawncher hawmh prakowi pela ching reng diah.<verse eid="PRO 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 27:24" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow dawngthawnguan dow nik dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:24">mangra paw chowngchowng saksakma nik dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 27:25" />Ngenta bawrchak kung kowi kowh bawrchak sar awr awm mih uang pawla pe diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:25">now hungh kowi kowh awm mih pram sar paw cham krawi ngenah now uang pawla pe diah.<verse eid="PRO 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 27:26" />Nahanow en kowh ruapur pawi hownia en naka tawnguat kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:26">now en kowh rua sung hown en naia ranla krawng bawn kown towbowt.<verse eid="PRO 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 27:27" />Nami klen kowi en hai en kimchakuüa vüi paw ahuma en naka iawn tui kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 27:27">nami kham hanow en kowh nar malauüa hawmh paw kow naiung kown towbowt.<verse eid="PRO 27:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PRO 28" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 28:1" />Maru krawiah dowi chepaw maru ngak dow powt reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:1">Tawkche achinawmma mih maru dow krangsi iawng sakkraingma chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 28:2" />Prenchakuüa chang lup ngak rakowi kruitown miuüa tale reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:2">Tawkche kruitown mih kowh prengia hai tukra uowima hanow prenchakuüa iung reng.<verse eid="PRO 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 28:3" />Ngaraima mih lala tachang nowng hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:3">nami dow luprak piakla mih uangchak mang iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 28:4" />Ari aiang chün dowi miuüa dow maru ngakuüa pra tawi tangi reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:4">Tawkche ari aiang chün miuüa dow maru ngakuüa kowi kingküa reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 28:5" />Maru ngak dow tara nowm lawnguan kowi tuk dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:5">Tawkche Thurai low iawng uowi miuüa dow tara nowm lawnguan kowi tuk reng.<verse eid="PRO 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 28:6" />Kureng chepaw chang lup ngak mih maru dow iung dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:6">nami lak-e ngarai chepaw chang lup iung mih maru lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 28:7" />Ari aiang chün mih chauüa dow prengia uowima chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:7">Tawkche maru ngak hown kowh taiua mih chauüa dow u-pa kowi pe rukrai reng.<verse eid="PRO 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 28:8" />Tawngbak mih maru dow achütma paw tangka hanow kowmatia dawngthawnguan ahuma changah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:8">Tawkche aia kowh dawngthawnguan dow ngarawng ngarai miuüa kowi saksing sana mih maru nakata pe kown.<verse eid="PRO 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 28:9" />Tawngbak mih maru dow ari aiang kowi nowng mü dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:9">naiawng mih maru kowh prasi lük dow Thurai sui chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 28:10" />Maru iung kowi angak pra pawla mih dow aia nga rakowi napiak kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:10">Tawkche chang angak dowi mih maru dow naiung kown.<verse eid="PRO 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 28:11" />Kurengma miuüa dow kowmatia kowi tanü chanlai reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:11">Tawkche prengiama mih ngarai mih maru dow kurengma mih maru chanlai chow chanlai dowi chow mih tuk reng.<verse eid="PRO 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 28:12" />Achinawmma mih maru ka kruitownra now maru piaw reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:12">Tawkche maru ngak ka kruitownra now kram kowh maru tapet reng.<verse eid="PRO 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 28:13" />Kowmatia angak pet mih maru dow iuksown dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:13">Tawkche taphuang angak kung kowi tarip mih maru dow ka saksing sanara reng.<verse eid="PRO 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 28:14" />Ngak chang kowi atungma kram mih maru dow prasira uowima chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:14">Tawkche saktuak akhawtma mih maru dow ngak chang kowi kram dowi rakowi kla phih reng.<verse eid="PRO 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 28:15" />Angakma mih pren kruitown mih dow hek rangrang mih krangsi iawng hai krawi mak reng mih tawm iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:15">aia tut-e ngarawng ngarai miuüa lainowmma ngare chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 28:16" />Prengia uowi dowi mih kruitown mih dow lainowmma krawi chang nowng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:16">lawpha kowi sui mih kruitown mih dow chowngdawng sakklangma sing uowi reng.<verse eid="PRO 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 28:17" />Sai maru sak mih dow tuak krat hown kawm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:17">aia dow kowng dowi mowr cham powt panglang reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 28:17">Aia kowi dow miapaw hangkow pacham khowngah lah.<verse eid="PRO 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 28:18" />Achinawmma uowi mih maru dow naka lawngra kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:18">Tawkche chang ngak mih maru dow linlanma napiak kown.<verse eid="PRO 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 28:19" />Kowmatia krawng bawn kowi aklumma chang lup mih maru dow ahuma ka chakkham reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:19">Tawkche asung uowi dowi mih lup kowi pe khin mih maru dow achur khe ngarai reng.<verse eid="PRO 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 28:20" />Kaah sakowmma mih maru dow prasi ahuma ka reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:20">Tawkche alenma kureng kown nau mih maru dow ka ripra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 28:21" />Chet tara khe amia pra paw tawi tangi kown mih iung dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:21">kawmpah asekchow mih rakowi paw maru chang ngak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 28:22" />Lawphama mih maru dow kureng kowi towsak reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:22">Tawkche lawphara hownia aia nangarai kown mih aia tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 28:23" />Dai lai hown kiow mih lak-e lainowm hown krawi hawi mih lang iung,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:23">achur khe lainowm tek mih maru dow nalang ka ringkawra kown.<verse eid="PRO 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 28:24" />U-pa kowh uanh kuta kung kowi angak nadowi pahai ka tuak mih maru dow maru ngak chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:24">aia dow krawi chang anowng apowng mih maru ngak iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 28:25" />Lawphama mih maru dow towk ran reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:25">Tawkche CHAKRAMANG luk kowi owmsak mih dow iuksown reng.<verse eid="PRO 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 28:26" />Kowmatia tukra luk kowi owmsak mih maru dow abualama chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:26">Tawkche chanlaira tiama kowi mang mih maru dow ka lawngra reng.<verse eid="PRO 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 28:27" />Ngaraima mih kowi khowng mih maru dow khawr dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:27">Tawkche ngarai miuüa kowi khowng kown nau dowi mih dow ahuma ka piati reng.<verse eid="PRO 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 28:28" />Maru ngakuüa che ka kruitownra now maru tapet reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 28:28">Tawkche maru ngakuüa piak now achinawmma miuüa kowh nowng changra uang hu reng.<verse eid="PRO 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PRO 29" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 29:1" />Tawngbak mih maru dow pringhawi laiklow ta chepaw saktuak akhawtma changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:1">naiawng mih maru dow linlanma napiak hanow nami hownia naiung kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PRO 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 29:2" />Achinawmma mih maru ka kruitownra now maru awmrawm reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:2">Tawkche maru ngak ka kruitownra now maru kar reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 29:3" />Chanlaira kowi sakrau mih maru dow u-pa kowi pe awmrawmra reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:3">Tawkche chawkkrawma hown taiua mih maru kowh dow dawngthawnguan piak reng.<verse eid="PRO 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 29:4" />Mang che chet tara nowm hanow pren iung reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:4">Tawkche bümsua chak dawma now pren piak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 29:5" />Tawngbak mih maru dow kowmatia kimping namkhetuüa kowi dai lai hown krawi kiow reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:5">naiawng mih maru dow kowmatia luk kowi uang pawla phih mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 29:6" />Maru ngak dow kowmatia angak rakowi takhuowk reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:6">Tawkche maru iung dow piaw se tek meng reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 29:7" />Achinawmma mih maru dow ngarai miuüa kowi nalawngah kown mih tuak reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:7">Tawkche maru ngakuüa dow ngarai miuüa lawnguan kowi tuak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 29:8" />Prawngren dawma miuüa dow marowchakuüa kowi krawi towk ran reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:8">Tawkche chanlai miuüa dow maru kowi prowng pe kunmarau reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 29:9" />Chanlaima mih maru che bualama mih maru kowi towng pe tara hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:9">bualama mih maru dow kunma chepaw narau kown, ren chepaw nalawt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 29:9">Tawkche tawng iawng paw iungra sia nauang phaw kown nadowi.<verse eid="PRO 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 29:10" />Sai sak mih maru dow angak uowi dowi mih maru kowi sui reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:10">aia dow maru iung kowi krawi sai kown mih sangkrang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 29:11" />Abualama mih maru dow tüng kunmarau reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:11">Tawkche chanlaima mih maru dow town sak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 29:12" />Kruitown mih che daila laiklow sünta khai hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:12">aia kowh maru iukuüa paw dailalu naphaw bowk kown.<verse eid="PRO 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 29:13" />Pachap kowi dow ngaraima mih maru hai nowng chang powng chang mih maru akat sang chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:13">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatchi dow CHAKRAMANG peah mik mih maru kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 29:14" />Tawngbak mih mang dow ngarawng ngaraima miuüa kowi tara nowm chet pe reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:14">naiawng mih mang dow chowngchowng saksakma ka chowm mang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 29:15" />Müa dangra hai pringhawira hownia dow ka chanlaira reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:15">Tawkche pring hawiah dowi mih chauüa dow u-pa kowi pe rukrai reng.<verse eid="PRO 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 29:16" />Maru ngak che ka kruitownra now angak prung reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:16">Tawkche amatni piak mih dow achinawmma miuüa nakhi kown.<verse eid="PRO 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 29:17" />En kowh chauüa kowi hawiah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:17">nahanow aia rakowi dow en nathaulang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:17">now aia dow nape en awmrawmra kown.<verse eid="PRO 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 29:18" />Thurai kruitownah dowi mih pren dow thaulangra uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:18">Tawkche CHAKRAMANG ari aiang chün mih maru dow prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 29:19" />Nar kowi dow laiklow hown nowng hawi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:19">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow tukta chepaw nachün kown nadowi.<verse eid="PRO 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 29:20" />Rik tuakah kaneu dowi kowi alenma tek lai mih maru lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:20">abualama mih maru kowh chownglawng lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 29:21" />En towah mih nar kowi che sowm hownia aia nau mih srui en peah hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:21">achur kowi aia dow en kowh dawngthawnguan maten napawta en kown.<verse eid="PRO 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 29:22" />Kunma ngakma mih maru dow hau ran reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:22">kunma ngakma mih maru dow ahuma chang ngak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 29:23" />Bawrima mih maru dow piak reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:23">Tawkche khamsum khamdaw mih maru dow ka ringkawra reng,<verse eid="PRO 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 29:24" />Kuk mih hown tawi tahum now kowmatia dow chowng kowmatia ransu reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:24">aia kowi dow towk pe sawi chepaw tawngpaw taphuang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 29:25" />Maru kowi kram mih maru dow leng kowi tasowk reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:25">Tawkche Thurai luk kowi neplawng nesak mih dow thaulangma uowi reng.<verse eid="PRO 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 29:26" />Tawngbak mih maru dow chet tara khe aia prakowi mang tawi tangila mih nau reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 29:26">Tawkche maru kowi kowh tara nowm chet mih dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih.<verse eid="PRO 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 29:27" />Achinawmma mih maru dow maru ngak kowi sui reng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 29:27">now tiama nowm kowi mang mih kowi dow maru ngak suiah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 29:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PRO 30" />
  <para style="s1">Agur kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 30:1" />Mami dow Jake kowh chapa Agur tekah mih laiklow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:1">Aw Thurai, ang kawm lai bowt kowbow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:1">ang kawm krang sak ter iawmlawm towbowt kowbow.<verse eid="PRO 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 30:2" />Ang dow maru lak-e kowh lang buala mih maru chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:2">ang kowh dow maru kowh iawng tukra uowi dowi.<verse eid="PRO 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 30:3" />Ang dow tawi tasang chanlaira dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:3">chimsaima mih Thurai lawnguan kowi tukra paw ang kowh uowi dowi.<verse eid="PRO 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 30:4" />Mukuang kowi pün mih hai mukuang hownia uang dowm mih mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:4">Rut hown ka dowk li mih mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:4">Tawnguat hown nowng krüm tui mih mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:4">Lusa tali tingnui rihi amia chow thawp?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:4">Aia ming hai achapa ming tawng chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:4">En che tuk khai hanow tek ang diah.<verse eid="PRO 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 30:5" />Thurai lai maten dow anowmma pami khi-ah amatra khowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:5">aia tut-e kowh tatung tanim miuüa tut-e aia dow kawngma iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 30:6" />Aia laiklow hown tawng laiklow paw hangkow bawngla diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:6">nadowi now aia mih natüng en atawi hai en dailama pami natüng en kown chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 30:7" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en hownia ang nau mih uowi pre chap;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:7">nami dow ang sing uowi reng tak khe pe ang ngengche diah.<verse eid="PRO 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 30:8" />Lowk kowi dow limmara hai dai lai tek mih ang hownia alakma henta ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:8">now pre kowi dow ngaraima hai kurengma hauang chang ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:8">ang lakkeah mih chakkham krowngchow pe ang reng diah.<verse eid="PRO 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 30:9" />Ka hu lai paw ang natamata en hanow, “Mia chow CHAKRAMANG?” padow ang tek kown chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:9">now ngarai lai paw cham ku hanow ang kowh CHAKRAMANG ming ang napiakta kown chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 30:10" />Kim iah tut-e nar kowi hangkow howng pe ming ngak diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:10">nadowi now aia nape en piati kown, now en nangare kown chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 30:11" />Pa kowi kowh pe piati mih maru paw uowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:11">now u kowi ringkaw dowi mih maru paw uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 30:12" />Amatni dow kowmatia kowi achinawmma tanü khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:12">Tawkche amatni dow asür alawkma kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 30:13" />Amatni kowh mik dow bawrira atekma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:13">amatni kowh mik mük dow suiiai kaniaima chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 30:14" />Amatni kowh iüng dow saidawng iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:14">now amatni kowh sah dow saichow iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:14">Amatni dow naiawngün hown ngarawng ngaraima miuüa kowi krawi chata reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 30:15" />Lawphama mih maru dow ka hu nau hu chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:15">amatni dow, “Pe küng, pe küng,” pahai lü haplap chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:15">Katpaw du dowi mih uowi sum chap,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:15">now katpaw sak-ih dowi mih paw uowi tali chap chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 30:16" />Naiawngün dow kowng miuüa uowira, ka chah dowi mih masiuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:16">katpaw du tui dowi mih krawng hai katpaw sak-ih dowi mih maih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 30:17" />Kowmatia pa kowi khare mih maru kowh mik dow nalaita pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:17">now u laiklow chün dowi mih maru kowh mik paw nalaita pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:17">Naiawng mih maru kowh mik dow lawngrawi kowi kowh uaak hawmh nalaita pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:17">naiawngün mik dow <char style="w">langta</char> chauüa nachata pe kown.<verse eid="PRO 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 30:18" />Ang awdaah nowm nowm mih uowi sum chap,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:18">mapaw ang tuktaah dowi mih paw uowi tali chap chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 30:19" />Kuang dawng kowi tawng iawng chow uamu tuk iow khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:19">hua luk kowi tawng iawng chow rua tuk sowr khai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:19">sata kowi tawng iawng chow chawnlawng tuk tapowng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:19">tawng iawng chow masiuüa hown kachakuüa tuk tanau khai.<verse eid="PRO 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 30:20" />Chang iang mih masiuüa dow maiawng:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:20">aia dow cham ki taphua taiua kung kowi luta prowng hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:20">“Tawng angak paw ang chang dowi,” pahai tek reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 30:21" />Lusa dow sum chap mih dik hown chür reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:21">lusa nowng kham dowi mih dik dow uowi tali chap chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 30:22" />Nami dow nar uang chowng mang khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:22">bualama mih maru aduma ka cha khe,<verse eid="PRO 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 30:23" />suiiai kaniaima mih masiuüa ka hua khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:23">narma chowng kim iah masi khe chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 30:24" />Lusa kowi achachow mih asadua uowi sum chap.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:24">Tawkche naiawngün dow prengia chakma chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 30:25" />Lowng dow kür lang e nowm nowm mih chap chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:25">Tawkche amatni dow satma khin khe krüm chakkham reng.<verse eid="PRO 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 30:26" />Klüi dow kür uowi dowi mih asadua chap chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:26">Tawkche amatni dow hua pheng kowi chang kim reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 30:27" />Plawng hawmh kowh dow mang uowi dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:27">nachenganchepaw amatni dow ahawmsang cham iow reng.<verse eid="PRO 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 30:28" />Tuisrambowngmow kowi dow rut hown plawmah chep chepaw ia.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:28">Tawkche aia dow mang kim kowi ka uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 30:29" />Amang krang bawrima mih uowi sum chap,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:29">aw nadowi, uowi tali chap chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 30:30" />Naiawngün dow kaurawng uaramchak kowi kowh lang kür mih krangsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:30">aia dow lowra mih kaurawng uaramchak kowi khi chepaw kram dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 30:31" />Hawkawma mih uaklang hai hawktawkma mih ruala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:31">now aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi kruitown mih mang chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 30:32" />Kowmatia kowi che en tanüla aiuk khai hanow nami tuak taingta diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:32">now maru kowi nachang angak kown mih tuak taingta diah.<verse eid="PRO 30:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 30:33" />Iawn tui klawk khe haiah rengreng now chowng thuapat reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 30:33">nakawng kowi merta naknak now vi lawt reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:33">Nami iawng kunmarau mih kowi dua pe kunma rengreng now taran reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 30:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PRO 31" />
  <para style="s">Mang Lemuel kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 31:1" />Maiawngün dow mang Lemuel kowi kowh a-u sangah mih laiklow chekhai. A-u tek pe mih,<verse eid="PRO 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 31:2" />“Chapa ow, en dow ang pen en mih chah chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:2">Thurai tut-e awr lüah kowh ang ka en mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 31:3" />Masiuüa tut-e hangkow iawm kür diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:3">masiuüa dow manguüa kowi piak mih chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 31:4" />“Aw Lemuel, manguüa nakham grep tui kown mih taka dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:4">kruitown miuüa nalü arak kown mih paw taka dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 31:5" />Amatni che kham rak khai hanow natamata rirow kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:5">now ngarai miuüa kowi nachet pe tara nowm kown nadowk.<verse eid="PRO 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 31:6" />Kowng kown chowbowt miuüa kowi peah arak diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:6">tuak kawm tuak krat miuüa kowi peah grep tui diah.<verse eid="PRO 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 31:7" />Nahanow amatni dow amatni khawr mih lawnguan natamata kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:7">now amatni kawmkrat mih lawnguan paw natamata kown towbowt.<verse eid="PRO 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 31:8" />Kowmatia vüi tuk prow tuk tek dowi miuüa kowi tawi prow pe diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:8">ngarema miuüa kowh kak tataing mih vüi tawi prow tawi tek pe diah.<verse eid="PRO 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 31:9" />Uowi phülü dowi hai chet tara nowm diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:9">krat miuüa hai ngarai miuüa kowi tawi chet pe tara nowm diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masiuüa iung kowh chowm krang uowi krang</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 31:10" />A-u plan tek mih, “Masiuüa iung ka kown mih dow akratma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:10">Nami dow asung khakma mih hua lak-e khowm asung lang uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 31:11" />Aia kowi dow ahua owmah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:11">aia rakowi lakke mih maten ahua ka reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 31:12" />Aia sing uowi mowr dow ahua iung müa aia chang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:12">ahua piakla müa dow aia chang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 31:13" />Aia dow ruapur pawi hai adipükchow mih la cham krawi paw reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:13">nami hown dow sak sowrma hown aia chang lup reng.<verse eid="PRO 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 31:14" />Aia dow changla kun mih chawnlawng iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:14">aia dow alakma hownia cham paw chakkham reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 31:15" />Aia dow mur rü hanow kimchakuüa vüi kamrüt pe chakkham reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:15">now anarmauüa nachangah kown mih lup bak paw aia khowm bowk pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 31:16" />Aia dow ran laih dowi rawn rik müah kaneu hanow ran reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:16">aia dow aia kramah mih tangka hown chang grep krum reng.<verse eid="PRO 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 31:17" />Aia dow aklumma hai akürma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:17">now towsakma hown chang lup reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 31:18" />Aia kowh lup hownia maratra uang ting mih dow aia tuk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:18">aia dow iak-e paw maibu nowi kowi chang lup reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 31:19" />Aia dow lum la reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:19">now kawng uan reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 31:20" />Aia kowh rut dow ka dowi miuüa kowi iaw pe reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:20">aia kowh bawng dow ngaraima miuüa dawiah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 31:21" />Arua khin uang ting chepaw aia kimchakuüa vüi tawngpaw tuak krat dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:21">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni vüi dow kowrmow awm uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 31:22" />Aia dow phangbek luk kowi kowh dau müa uanthowr kawng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:22">aia khupah mih paw adipükchow mih la hown kowh tawnguat hai asung khakma mih aruachow mih tawnguat chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 31:23" />Ahua dow marow tapplawt kowi ka ringkawra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:23">now nakowi dow pren kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa hown taiua chowm reng.<verse eid="PRO 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 31:24" />Aia dow adipükchow mih la hown kawng tawnguat hanow sumah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:24">kekawm uan ün dow chang kun miuüa kowi aia sum pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 31:25" />Aia kowh kürra hai ringkawra dow uowi ahuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:25">pur pra kowh lawnguan kowi kram dowi kowh ren reng.<verse eid="PRO 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 31:26" />Aia dow chanlaira laiklow krawi tek reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:26">now sakrau saktuak hown krawi tüngsang reng.<verse eid="PRO 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 31:27" />Aia dow kimchakuüa lakke takla mih lawnguan kowi pe ching reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:27">aia dow silikma uowi phülü dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 31:28" />Achauüa dow aia kowi kiowah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:28">now ahua paw kiowah se maiawng tek pe reng:<verse eid="PRO 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 31:29" />‘Lusa kowi masiuüa aiungma mih uowi ahuma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:29">Tawkche kowbüah lak-e en lang iung chekhai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 31:30" />Sangprowk lai tek iungma mih dow nowngia kuan reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:30">now klangiungra paw nik dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 31:30">Tawkche CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih masiuüa dow ka kiowra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 31:31" />Naiawng mih masiuüa kowi peah ringkawra diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PRO 31:31">now aia changta mih lup rakowi maru pur kowi kiowah diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="PRO 31:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 31" />
</usx>